(2895564, 403334, 21714, '<td valign="top">What a way to photograph a chair!<br/>Brilliant.</td>', 'What a way to photograph a chair!Brilliant.', '2006-10-04 12:01:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2895567, 406043, 66575, '<td valign="top">awesome!  i love that it seems solemn and playful at the same time.  and the blue/black shades are perfect.</td>', 'awesome!  i love that it seems solemn and playful at the same time.  and the blue/black shades are perfect.', '2006-10-04 12:03:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2895573, 406060, 59684, '<td valign="top">Needs more brightness for the zebras and maybe more sharpness.</td>', 'Needs more brightness for the zebras and maybe more sharpness.', '2006-10-04 12:04:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2895586, 405467, 29293, '<td valign="top">beautiful light</td>', 'beautiful light', '2006-10-04 12:08:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2895590, 405162, 21714, '<td valign="top">Excellent.<br/>I love what you have done here. Interesting how you''ve composed with 5 pairs and a lone person to grab attention. Would love to see it blown really big and on a wall. I know I am going to enjoy looking at it and .. thinking ..</td>', 'Excellent.I love what you have done here. Interesting how you''ve composed with 5 pairs and a lone person to grab attention. Would love to see it blown really big and on a wall. I know I am going to enjoy looking at it and .. thinking ..', '2006-10-04 12:10:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2895599, 405826, 21714, '<td valign="top">Beautifully done.</td>', 'Beautifully done.', '2006-10-04 12:12:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2895600, 406002, 29293, '<td valign="top">i love bean shots good job</td>', 'i love bean shots good job', '2006-10-04 12:12:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2895617, 405388, 29293, '<td valign="top">great capture of the moment</td>', 'great capture of the moment', '2006-10-04 12:17:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2895620, 404527, 21714, '<td valign="top">Now this is an interesting shot. With so many mug shots of these fellas in every challenge, it''s a pleasure to see one like this. It''s not just about what a cat looks like, but about what a cat is about too. You''ve photographed and presented it beautifully.</td>', 'Now this is an interesting shot. With so many mug shots of these fellas in every challenge, it''s a pleasure to see one like this. It''s not just about what a cat looks like, but about what a cat is about too. You''ve photographed and presented it beautifully.', '2006-10-04 12:18:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2895634, 402445, 21714, '<td valign="top">Excellent angle to shoot from. The Godess looks pretty pleased with the creator.</td>', 'Excellent angle to shoot from. The Godess looks pretty pleased with the creator.', '2006-10-04 12:22:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2895639, 405782, 29293, '<td valign="top">oh man i love dilana!!!  she should have won.  did you get to photograph the show or you know her??? how cool since i am a huge fan you get a 10</td>', 'oh man i love dilana!!!  she should have won.  did you get to photograph the show or you know her??? how cool since i am a huge fan you get a 10', '2006-10-04 12:23:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2895645, 405788, 29293, '<td valign="top">oh man another rock star super nova photo!  i think dilana should have won but i liked magni...9 for subject matter!</td>', 'oh man another rock star super nova photo!  i think dilana should have won but i liked magni...9 for subject matter!', '2006-10-04 12:25:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2895683, 403334, 29293, '<td valign="top">nice perspective</td>', 'nice perspective', '2006-10-04 12:33:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2895751, 404968, 4226, '<td valign="top">this is high key image. I don''t see how this works for high contrast.</td>', 'this is high key image. I don''t see how this works for high contrast.', '2006-10-04 12:56:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2895870, 406042, 65319, '<td valign="top">This photo is well composed and the lighting is very well done to capture the mood.  This photo has a sophisticated presence with just the right touch of innocence.  9.</td>', 'This photo is well composed and the lighting is very well done to capture the mood.  This photo has a sophisticated presence with just the right touch of innocence.  9.', '2006-10-04 13:35:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2895897, 405350, 65319, '<td valign="top">I have the impression that the wonderful DOF has more control here than the strength of the subject matter.  But, I like the sense here of beauty growing somewhat vulnerably in a vast opening of space.  6.</td>', 'I have the impression that the wonderful DOF has more control here than the strength of the subject matter.  But, I like the sense here of beauty growing somewhat vulnerably in a vast opening of space.  6.', '2006-10-04 13:41:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2895914, 405515, 63384, '<td valign="top">Amazing.</td>', 'Amazing.', '2006-10-04 13:45:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2895937, 404037, 65319, '<td valign="top">This photo portrays not just the typical zebra side by side shot, but captures the sense of family and interaction of their lifestyle which gives this photo character!  8.</td>', 'This photo portrays not just the typical zebra side by side shot, but captures the sense of family and interaction of their lifestyle which gives this photo character!  8.', '2006-10-04 13:51:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2895952, 406000, 65319, '<td valign="top">Beautiful and elegant angle for this lovely horse.  In the advanced editing (I know this is basic), the sand and background might be worked over to give this photo a stronger and more polished impact.  7.</td>', 'Beautiful and elegant angle for this lovely horse.  In the advanced editing (I know this is basic), the sand and background might be worked over to give this photo a stronger and more polished impact.  7.', '2006-10-04 13:55:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2896025, 404117, 65319, '<td valign="top">Wow.  This cat is beautiful and feisty with very striking eyes.  Your photo brings out all of these features very well!  It''s unfortunate that the lovely background on the right side couldn''t have been easiy created on the left side.  The blending of the white light into the white fur somewhat detracts from the photo.  But, the power of expression overshadows these (IMHO) minor issues.  9.</td>', 'Wow.  This cat is beautiful and feisty with very striking eyes.  Your photo brings out all of these features very well!  It''s unfortunate that the lovely background on the right side couldn''t have been easiy created on the left side.  The blending of the white light into the white fur somewhat detracts from the photo.  But, the power of expression overshadows these (IMHO) minor issues.  9.', '2006-10-04 14:22:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2896047, 405697, 65319, '<td valign="top">I admire the explosive and powerful drama of the light.  9</td>', 'I admire the explosive and powerful drama of the light.  9', '2006-10-04 14:37:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2896056, 404505, 65319, '<td valign="top">The rich colors of this photo cleary stand out.  However, I would like to see more use of high contrast lighting to bring out and enhance the power of the subject matter.  6.</td>', 'The rich colors of this photo cleary stand out.  However, I would like to see more use of high contrast lighting to bring out and enhance the power of the subject matter.  6.', '2006-10-04 14:39:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2896059, 403988, 34134, '<td valign="top">Love to, but I can only go as high as 10!</td>', 'Love to, but I can only go as high as 10!', '2006-10-04 14:41:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2896077, 403161, 65319, '<td valign="top">The haunting and eerie lighting of this dark and powerful structure make me want to see this photo in a much bigger format (the biggest dimension can be 640!).  I have the impression of wandering around in a dark labyrinth and wary, but strangely curious of what''s around the corner.  The white frame detracts from the feeling of this photo.  6.</td>', 'The haunting and eerie lighting of this dark and powerful structure make me want to see this photo in a much bigger format (the biggest dimension can be 640!).  I have the impression of wandering around in a dark labyrinth and wary, but strangely curious of what''s around the corner.  The white frame detracts from the feeling of this photo.  6.', '2006-10-04 14:44:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2896090, 403825, 65319, '<td valign="top">This photo captures the little girls intense concentration, but the hand in the background seems distracting.  7.</td>', 'This photo captures the little girls intense concentration, but the hand in the background seems distracting.  7.', '2006-10-04 14:47:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2896105, 405855, 65319, '<td valign="top">This little boy has a wonderful expression on his face which captures the title of your shot well.  However, the placement of the white in the background detracts from this shot.  7.</td>', 'This little boy has a wonderful expression on his face which captures the title of your shot well.  However, the placement of the white in the background detracts from this shot.  7.', '2006-10-04 14:50:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2896108, 405931, 65319, '<td valign="top">Beautiful contract and the clear lines of the rays add to the power of this photo.  7.</td>', 'Beautiful contract and the clear lines of the rays add to the power of this photo.  7.', '2006-10-04 14:50:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2896134, 405697, 34134, '<td valign="top">Great rays. I know these are really tough to capture!</td>', 'Great rays. I know these are really tough to capture!', '2006-10-04 14:56:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2896141, 405606, 65319, '<td valign="top">I love the highlighted contrast in the leaves in motion.  However, the road appears slightly blown out which detracts from the photo.  6</td>', 'I love the highlighted contrast in the leaves in motion.  However, the road appears slightly blown out which detracts from the photo.  6', '2006-10-04 14:59:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2896149, 404652, 65319, '<td valign="top">Although this picture meets the challenge, personally, I would have loved to see this beautiful young lady with the lovely eyes in a more seriously elegant  fashion.  6.</td>', 'Although this picture meets the challenge, personally, I would have loved to see this beautiful young lady with the lovely eyes in a more seriously elegant  fashion.  6.', '2006-10-04 15:01:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2896158, 405467, 65319, '<td valign="top">The rich color of this basket is very clearly demonstrated in this photo and brings to mind the arrival of Autumn.  6.</td>', 'The rich color of this basket is very clearly demonstrated in this photo and brings to mind the arrival of Autumn.  6.', '2006-10-04 15:03:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2896163, 403027, 15204, '<td valign="top">Although I can see that you increased the contrast to create this ''high-key'' look, the light itself is actually pretty flat.  On camera flash is really tough to use and get good results with for portraits.  I know that bathrooms can be difficult for window lighting, but natural light would have really imroved this image.  I love his expression and the angle is nice and whimsical for this shot.  I think it would be better without his hands cut off.  You have a really cute little one, here.</td>', 'Although I can see that you increased the contrast to create this ''high-key'' look, the light itself is actually pretty flat.  On camera flash is really tough to use and get good results with for portraits.  I know that bathrooms can be difficult for window lighting, but natural light would have really imroved this image.  I love his expression and the angle is nice and whimsical for this shot.  I think it would be better without his hands cut off.  You have a really cute little one, here.', '2006-10-04 15:05:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2896180, 405792, 65319, '<td valign="top">With this photo, I have the impression of emptiness just gasping to be filled with only a single drop of water to fullfill that desire.  I wonder if this photo could be cropped differently as the large black in the upper left detracts (IMHO) from the photo.  For power and expression...9.</td>', 'With this photo, I have the impression of emptiness just gasping to be filled with only a single drop of water to fullfill that desire.  I wonder if this photo could be cropped differently as the large black in the upper left detracts (IMHO) from the photo.  For power and expression...9.', '2006-10-04 15:08:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2896202, 406002, 65319, '<td valign="top">I love the sense of motion the curves give to the stationary buildings.  7.</td>', 'I love the sense of motion the curves give to the stationary buildings.  7.', '2006-10-04 15:16:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2896205, 404829, 65319, '<td valign="top">What a lovely young lady.  The background frames her well with the contrast of her beautiful black hair and dark soulful eyes.  The gentle light blue in the hat adds to the polish of this photo.  7</td>', 'What a lovely young lady.  The background frames her well with the contrast of her beautiful black hair and dark soulful eyes.  The gentle light blue in the hat adds to the polish of this photo.  7', '2006-10-04 15:17:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2896209, 405726, 65319, '<td valign="top">Wonderful brilliant and rich colors.  7.</td>', 'Wonderful brilliant and rich colors.  7.', '2006-10-04 15:18:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2896218, 405064, 65319, '<td valign="top">I like the DOF and the very alert expression of the beautiful dog is captured well in this photo.  Would like to see more angle in the face.  6.</td>', 'I like the DOF and the very alert expression of the beautiful dog is captured well in this photo.  Would like to see more angle in the face.  6.', '2006-10-04 15:21:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2896224, 403703, 65319, '<td valign="top">The background of this picture is quite dramatic.  This picture would carry a higher impact with flowers that carried a higher energy.  6.</td>', 'The background of this picture is quite dramatic.  This picture would carry a higher impact with flowers that carried a higher energy.  6.', '2006-10-04 15:22:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2896239, 404527, 65319, '<td valign="top">I like the stretching pose, and would have liked to see the eyes looking up at you to make this photo just perfect!  6.</td>', 'I like the stretching pose, and would have liked to see the eyes looking up at you to make this photo just perfect!  6.', '2006-10-04 15:25:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2896241, 404935, 65319, '<td valign="top">This beautiful pictures flows with great clarity and detail.  8.</td>', 'This beautiful pictures flows with great clarity and detail.  8.', '2006-10-04 15:26:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2896246, 405950, 65319, '<td valign="top">Brilliant colors.  Would like to see different selection of focus in more parts of the photo to bring these brilliant leaves out.  6.</td>', 'Brilliant colors.  Would like to see different selection of focus in more parts of the photo to bring these brilliant leaves out.  6.', '2006-10-04 15:29:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2896249, 404553, 65319, '<td valign="top">I have a very strong impression of faded dreams and lost hopes.  8.</td>', 'I have a very strong impression of faded dreams and lost hopes.  8.', '2006-10-04 15:30:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2896255, 405333, 65319, '<td valign="top">Very well executed photo.  The angles, the gradiation of light; and the clarity very good.  8.</td>', 'Very well executed photo.  The angles, the gradiation of light; and the clarity very good.  8.', '2006-10-04 15:32:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2896261, 404401, 65319, '<td valign="top">This photo is very expressive and powerful with a strong poetic quality.  The waves of the stems flowing up and beyond the viewers eye bring home the beauty of the title "Resentment of the Dream."  However, the line of frame at the top of photo breaks that beautiful flow upward and detracts from the beautiful flow of the photo (IMHO).  8.</td>', 'This photo is very expressive and powerful with a strong poetic quality.  The waves of the stems flowing up and beyond the viewers eye bring home the beauty of the title "Resentment of the Dream."  However, the line of frame at the top of photo breaks that beautiful flow upward and detracts from the beautiful flow of the photo (IMHO).  8.', '2006-10-04 15:35:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2896277, 406046, 65319, '<td valign="top">I think this dog has lovely amber eyes and would like to see a more sophisticated and high contrast portrait style of this very striking dog.  5.</td>', 'I think this dog has lovely amber eyes and would like to see a more sophisticated and high contrast portrait style of this very striking dog.  5.', '2006-10-04 15:39:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2896287, 405789, 65319, '<td valign="top">Lovely color, but appears somewhat fuzzy in focus.</td>', 'Lovely color, but appears somewhat fuzzy in focus.', '2006-10-04 15:42:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2896289, 405978, 65319, '<td valign="top">For such a stark photo, I would have loved to see greater detail in the image.  6.</td>', 'For such a stark photo, I would have loved to see greater detail in the image.  6.', '2006-10-04 15:43:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2896301, 404993, 65319, '<td valign="top">The lost and intense expression of this cat really comes across well with your use of high contrast lighting.  7.</td>', 'The lost and intense expression of this cat really comes across well with your use of high contrast lighting.  7.', '2006-10-04 15:47:14.000000', NULL, 1),
