(2896306, 405806, 65319, '<td valign="top">Although I see quite a bit of high constrast, the photo is very busy and overwhelms instead of adding to the subject matter of the red apples.  6.</td>', 'Although I see quite a bit of high constrast, the photo is very busy and overwhelms instead of adding to the subject matter of the red apples.  6.', '2006-10-04 15:49:28.000000', NULL, 1),
