(2896640, 403960, 65858, '<td valign="top">It is high contrast, but I think the contrast is too distracting here.  The contrast seems to be detracting, rather than highlighting this image.  For instance, I can''t really tell what the man is doing - it loks like he''s being eaten by the tree.  =)</td>', 'It is high contrast, but I think the contrast is too distracting here.  The contrast seems to be detracting, rather than highlighting this image.  For instance, I can''t really tell what the man is doing - it loks like he''s being eaten by the tree.  =)', '2006-10-04 17:43:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2896645, 403476, 65858, '<td valign="top">I think the lower half of the image is interesting, while the upper half is a bit dull.</td>', 'I think the lower half of the image is interesting, while the upper half is a bit dull.', '2006-10-04 17:45:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2896655, 402815, 65858, '<td valign="top">Cool shot.  The harsh shadows make for high contrast.  Even still, there''s something about this picture that seems a little flat.  Maybe because I''m used to mountains.  =)</td>', 'Cool shot.  The harsh shadows make for high contrast.  Even still, there''s something about this picture that seems a little flat.  Maybe because I''m used to mountains.  =)', '2006-10-04 17:47:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2896658, 405538, 65858, '<td valign="top">Neat shot, nice composition.  Well done contrast, and very sharp.</td>', 'Neat shot, nice composition.  Well done contrast, and very sharp.', '2006-10-04 17:48:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2896668, 403104, 65858, '<td valign="top">I guess I don''t really get the subject.  This looks like a snapshot of a driveway, though at least the perspective is not what you''d see everyday.</td>', 'I guess I don''t really get the subject.  This looks like a snapshot of a driveway, though at least the perspective is not what you''d see everyday.', '2006-10-04 17:49:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2896677, 405623, 65858, '<td valign="top">Nice clean shot.  There''s good contrast among the colors.  But it looks a bit more like a snapshot than a competition entry.</td>', 'Nice clean shot.  There''s good contrast among the colors.  But it looks a bit more like a snapshot than a competition entry.', '2006-10-04 17:50:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2896681, 404951, 60868, '<td valign="top">wow....I like the pattern made by the trees...and the white light...and the colors</td>', 'wow....I like the pattern made by the trees...and the white light...and the colors', '2006-10-04 17:51:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2896692, 404993, 65858, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot.  Sharp and clean.  Without the DOF, desaturation, and contrast, this would have been a very ordinary, boring shot.  But this is a great example of how contrast can be used artistically to mute the distractions and draw your attention directly to the cat''s eyes.  8!</td>', 'Very nice shot.  Sharp and clean.  Without the DOF, desaturation, and contrast, this would have been a very ordinary, boring shot.  But this is a great example of how contrast can be used artistically to mute the distractions and draw your attention directly to the cat''s eyes.  8!', '2006-10-04 17:53:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2896696, 403759, 65858, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea, fairly sharp.  Good job.  I think more desaturation would have made it better for me.</td>', 'Interesting idea, fairly sharp.  Good job.  I think more desaturation would have made it better for me.', '2006-10-04 17:54:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2896699, 403484, 60868, '<td valign="top">Excellent DOF</td>', 'Excellent DOF', '2006-10-04 17:54:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2896734, 404016, 60868, '<td valign="top">wow... how did you do that?</td>', 'wow... how did you do that?', '2006-10-04 18:01:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2896746, 404417, 14010, '<td valign="top">Wonderful colors!</td>', 'Wonderful colors!', '2006-10-04 18:03:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2896749, 405168, 65858, '<td valign="top">I like the bird.  The large blue/green thing in the background is very distracting, imo.  More blur via DOF or less saturation may have improved this image.</td>', 'I like the bird.  The large blue/green thing in the background is very distracting, imo.  More blur via DOF or less saturation may have improved this image.', '2006-10-04 18:04:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2896750, 405382, 60868, '<td valign="top">Excellent idea</td>', 'Excellent idea', '2006-10-04 18:04:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2896753, 405001, 65858, '<td valign="top">Interesting simple image.  I like how I have to wonder at the scale.</td>', 'Interesting simple image.  I like how I have to wonder at the scale.', '2006-10-04 18:04:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2896757, 404928, 14010, '<td valign="top">Love the hairs on the forearms!</td>', 'Love the hairs on the forearms!', '2006-10-04 18:05:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2896762, 404553, 60868, '<td valign="top">and we have a winner</td>', 'and we have a winner', '2006-10-04 18:07:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2896765, 405978, 60868, '<td valign="top">simplicity is the best way to win</td>', 'simplicity is the best way to win', '2006-10-04 18:08:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2896781, 405905, 64175, '<td valign="top">I don''t like cats, but this one is so playful and the white "ball of fur" on the left, ready to pounce is fun.  Image is slightly blurred around face, but I''m still giving it a high score.  If you can present a cat pic and make me like it, as you have done here, you''ve accomplished a great deal.  Once again, nice photo.</td>', 'I don''t like cats, but this one is so playful and the white "ball of fur" on the left, ready to pounce is fun.  Image is slightly blurred around face, but I''m still giving it a high score.  If you can present a cat pic and make me like it, as you have done here, you''ve accomplished a great deal.  Once again, nice photo.', '2006-10-04 18:11:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2896788, 405974, 64175, '<td valign="top">I like religious icons and it is a nice photo with the depth of field blurring the wood cross behind it. But, I almost thing leaving that space on the left void (empty space) would have provided more of the themed "contrast".</td>', 'I like religious icons and it is a nice photo with the depth of field blurring the wood cross behind it. But, I almost thing leaving that space on the left void (empty space) would have provided more of the themed "contrast".', '2006-10-04 18:12:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2896789, 406046, 60868, '<td valign="top">the background is not one of the most appropriate imo</td>', 'the background is not one of the most appropriate imo', '2006-10-04 18:12:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2896793, 406053, 64175, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot. High color contrasts are not easy to pull off IMO in this challenge and you have done a superb job.</td>', 'Beautiful shot. High color contrasts are not easy to pull off IMO in this challenge and you have done a superb job.', '2006-10-04 18:13:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2896799, 406034, 65856, '<td valign="top">excellent. love the composition  9</td>', 'excellent. love the composition  9', '2006-10-04 18:15:34.000000', NULL, 1),
