(2896827, 405509, 64175, '<td valign="top">Not sure if you were going for the effect, but it is highly overexposed and the redish tint doesn''t really provide contrast as much as a darker color.</td>', 'Not sure if you were going for the effect, but it is highly overexposed and the redish tint doesn''t really provide contrast as much as a darker color.', '2006-10-04 18:25:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2896829, 403709, 65319, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful owl.  The object above his head is bit distracting.  7.</td>', 'What a beautiful owl.  The object above his head is bit distracting.  7.', '2006-10-04 18:25:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2896830, 404935, 60698, '<td valign="top">Nice black and white composition and contrast of shore, water and sky.</td>', 'Nice black and white composition and contrast of shore, water and sky.', '2006-10-04 18:25:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2896831, 404792, 60698, '<td valign="top">Simple and beautiful.</td>', 'Simple and beautiful.', '2006-10-04 18:26:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2896832, 404832, 64175, '<td valign="top">Love the shot. Not necessarily what I consider a lot of contrast (maybe if the skyline was darker, but very nice photo.</td>', 'Love the shot. Not necessarily what I consider a lot of contrast (maybe if the skyline was darker, but very nice photo.', '2006-10-04 18:26:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2896835, 403784, 64175, '<td valign="top">Image is too dark to provide the strong contrast desired.</td>', 'Image is too dark to provide the strong contrast desired.', '2006-10-04 18:27:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2896840, 405350, 14010, '<td valign="top">Perfect contrast!</td>', 'Perfect contrast!', '2006-10-04 18:32:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2896846, 404823, 64175, '<td valign="top">One of only a few (IMO) nice color contrasts in this competition. I wish the chair wer just a bit more in focus so that it "popped".  Overall nice shot and I''m giving it an 8 (I really like the lime-ish green color in the right edge of the phot behind that tree.  Great job.</td>', 'One of only a few (IMO) nice color contrasts in this competition. I wish the chair wer just a bit more in focus so that it "popped".  Overall nice shot and I''m giving it an 8 (I really like the lime-ish green color in the right edge of the phot behind that tree.  Great job.', '2006-10-04 18:33:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2896850, 405606, 64175, '<td valign="top">A bit too much glare off the street IMO.</td>', 'A bit too much glare off the street IMO.', '2006-10-04 18:34:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2896868, 405740, 14010, '<td valign="top">Oh this is absolutely wonderful!</td>', 'Oh this is absolutely wonderful!', '2006-10-04 18:39:23.000000', NULL, 1),
