(2897137, 405667, 10268, '<td valign="top">I''ve never been one to be, I guess, disgusted by really any photograph, but man, there''s something about the way the skin looks in the photograph that really puts me off.</td>', 'I''ve never been one to be, I guess, disgusted by really any photograph, but man, there''s something about the way the skin looks in the photograph that really puts me off.', '2006-10-04 20:00:14.000000', NULL, 1),
