(2897291, 404351, 27763, '<td valign="top">Neat.  I like it.  Good job.</td>', 'Neat.  I like it.  Good job.', '2006-10-04 20:48:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897297, 405542, 36619, '<td valign="top">great image!</td>', 'great image!', '2006-10-04 20:49:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897298, 405001, 66193, '<td valign="top">love the lines.  wouldn''t have guessed this was a bridge.  interesting perspective.</td>', 'love the lines.  wouldn''t have guessed this was a bridge.  interesting perspective.', '2006-10-04 20:49:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897300, 403658, 27935, '<td valign="top">I love the contrasting newspaper vendors . . .wonderful!</td>', 'I love the contrasting newspaper vendors . . .wonderful!', '2006-10-04 20:49:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897301, 403329, 64795, '<td valign="top">The picture is too small.</td>', 'The picture is too small.', '2006-10-04 20:50:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897307, 405503, 49773, '<td valign="top">This is fantastic.</td>', 'This is fantastic.', '2006-10-04 20:50:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897308, 405984, 64795, '<td valign="top">Love the textures!</td>', 'Love the textures!', '2006-10-04 20:50:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897309, 402859, 66193, '<td valign="top">nice capture.  I think it might have worked better with the mountain not exactly in the center.  Might have meant a long walk though!</td>', 'nice capture.  I think it might have worked better with the mountain not exactly in the center.  Might have meant a long walk though!', '2006-10-04 20:50:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897313, 403993, 42013, '<td valign="top">I like it, maybe not glaringly HC but certainly meets challenge IMO</td>', 'I like it, maybe not glaringly HC but certainly meets challenge IMO', '2006-10-04 20:50:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897314, 404377, 66193, '<td valign="top">love how you let the clouds take center stage!</td>', 'love how you let the clouds take center stage!', '2006-10-04 20:50:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897315, 402336, 27935, '<td valign="top">a little blown?  but nice angle / mood</td>', 'a little blown?  but nice angle / mood', '2006-10-04 20:51:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897317, 402815, 66193, '<td valign="top">how''d you get this perspective?</td>', 'how''d you get this perspective?', '2006-10-04 20:51:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897320, 405492, 66193, '<td valign="top">nice composition!</td>', 'nice composition!', '2006-10-04 20:52:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897323, 404016, 66193, '<td valign="top">your post-processing makes this look like  a pencil drawing.  different in a good way.</td>', 'your post-processing makes this look like  a pencil drawing.  different in a good way.', '2006-10-04 20:52:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897324, 404850, 66193, '<td valign="top">like the blue eyes against the darker skin.  white hair tops it!</td>', 'like the blue eyes against the darker skin.  white hair tops it!', '2006-10-04 20:53:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897326, 405892, 66193, '<td valign="top">I like this one. one of the most interesting shots yet.</td>', 'I like this one. one of the most interesting shots yet.', '2006-10-04 20:53:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897331, 403703, 66193, '<td valign="top">very nice use of selective color.  best one yet (but only 1/4 of the way through.  we''ll see how it stands through the rest of the voting)</td>', 'very nice use of selective color.  best one yet (but only 1/4 of the way through.  we''ll see how it stands through the rest of the voting)', '2006-10-04 20:55:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897333, 405434, 42013, '<td valign="top">Focus is right on the material, head of the flower seems a little soft though. Related to composition, I think a very formal framing with straight lines(fix the creases) juxtoposed against the dead flower would have been a very interesting composition. As it is, the non parallel lines are a distraction.</td>', 'Focus is right on the material, head of the flower seems a little soft though. Related to composition, I think a very formal framing with straight lines(fix the creases) juxtoposed against the dead flower would have been a very interesting composition. As it is, the non parallel lines are a distraction.', '2006-10-04 20:55:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897335, 402483, 66193, '<td valign="top">nice composition, but it looks like the focus is a little off.  Pretty hard to manage such a narrow DOF (assuming this wasn''t cropped)</td>', 'nice composition, but it looks like the focus is a little off.  Pretty hard to manage such a narrow DOF (assuming this wasn''t cropped)', '2006-10-04 20:55:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897338, 405515, 36619, '<td valign="top">neat perspective</td>', 'neat perspective', '2006-10-04 20:56:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897339, 403362, 42013, '<td valign="top">Face looks familiar. Hmmm... I believe this to be HC.</td>', 'Face looks familiar. Hmmm... I believe this to be HC.', '2006-10-04 20:56:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897343, 405727, 42013, '<td valign="top">Not sure about the center crop but nice job with the focus and exposure</td>', 'Not sure about the center crop but nice job with the focus and exposure', '2006-10-04 20:57:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897346, 405185, 66193, '<td valign="top">nice approach I think.  For me, it would have worked with either the subject in focus, or purposefully way out of focus.  It''s just at that edge of focus where it''s distracting (I can''t decide if it''s supposed to be in focus or not).</td>', 'nice approach I think.  For me, it would have worked with either the subject in focus, or purposefully way out of focus.  It''s just at that edge of focus where it''s distracting (I can''t decide if it''s supposed to be in focus or not).', '2006-10-04 20:57:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897348, 405999, 42013, '<td valign="top">Good</td>', 'Good', '2006-10-04 20:57:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897350, 402939, 66193, '<td valign="top">good use of high contrast.  you use all the tonal range here.</td>', 'good use of high contrast.  you use all the tonal range here.', '2006-10-04 20:58:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897352, 405166, 66193, '<td valign="top">funny shot!</td>', 'funny shot!', '2006-10-04 20:58:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897355, 403784, 66193, '<td valign="top">not much contrast.  it all seems muted.</td>', 'not much contrast.  it all seems muted.', '2006-10-04 20:58:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897356, 403789, 54728, '<td valign="top">Nice crisp outline...but a little fuzzy on the nearer part of the lime.</td>', 'Nice crisp outline...but a little fuzzy on the nearer part of the lime.', '2006-10-04 20:59:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897360, 405950, 42013, '<td valign="top">Pretty even gradiation between light and dark. Perhaps the lighting was too soft to achieve a real contrasty picture.</td>', 'Pretty even gradiation between light and dark. Perhaps the lighting was too soft to achieve a real contrasty picture.', '2006-10-04 20:59:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897362, 405708, 42013, '<td valign="top">Classic example IMO. Great job of controlling the light on her hair, and yet maintaining strong shadow areas. Top of my list so far.</td>', 'Classic example IMO. Great job of controlling the light on her hair, and yet maintaining strong shadow areas. Top of my list so far.', '2006-10-04 21:00:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897366, 404877, 42013, '<td valign="top">Nice scene!  To expand... i found the repetitive shapes and lines very pleasing and interesting.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-10-11 20:09:02.</i></td>', 'Nice scene!  To expand... i found the repetitive shapes and lines very pleasing and interesting.', '2006-10-04 21:01:06.000000', '2006-10-11 21:09:02.000000', 1),
(2897367, 405204, 54728, '<td valign="top">Wow, I find that image really puzzling.  Interesting.</td>', 'Wow, I find that image really puzzling.  Interesting.', '2006-10-04 21:01:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897369, 405744, 66193, '<td valign="top">a couple of constructive criticisms.  A centered composition (kayaker right in the middle) tends to be a little boring.  A better composition would have had him in the right side of the frame, giving a sense of him moving into the frame.  I''m usually all for breaking the rules (rule of thirds here), but in this case, I think the rules would work.  Also, the out of focus subject is distracting.  Hard to get moving subjects in focus.  Good use of the entire tonal range, though.</td>', 'a couple of constructive criticisms.  A centered composition (kayaker right in the middle) tends to be a little boring.  A better composition would have had him in the right side of the frame, giving a sense of him moving into the frame.  I''m usually all for breaking the rules (rule of thirds here), but in this case, I think the rules would work.  Also, the out of focus subject is distracting.  Hard to get moving subjects in focus.  Good use of the entire tonal range, though.', '2006-10-04 21:01:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897375, 402663, 42013, '<td valign="top">its a pity i couldn''t see this a little larger. I like the composition(not sure about the tree) and your colors are nice to look at as well.</td>', 'its a pity i couldn''t see this a little larger. I like the composition(not sure about the tree) and your colors are nice to look at as well.', '2006-10-04 21:02:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897376, 405879, 65858, '<td valign="top">Cute shot - and a nice shock of red hair!</td>', 'Cute shot - and a nice shock of red hair!', '2006-10-04 21:02:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897378, 403568, 66193, '<td valign="top">a little too dark for me.  I know that we''re looking for high contrast, but here there''s nothing in the middle for me.</td>', 'a little too dark for me.  I know that we''re looking for high contrast, but here there''s nothing in the middle for me.', '2006-10-04 21:02:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897379, 406000, 65858, '<td valign="top">Very nice!  I love the contrast of dark hair to light horse - good texture, too.</td>', 'Very nice!  I love the contrast of dark hair to light horse - good texture, too.', '2006-10-04 21:03:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897383, 403295, 66193, '<td valign="top">nice use of contrast.  I like the threatening skies, too.  A more off-center composition would have made this one better, though (IMO).  Did you get any shots of this barn close-up?  I once heard a saying, "if it''s not interesting your too far away".  while this one is nice, a closer shot, with maybe an askew perspective would have made it dynamite.</td>', 'nice use of contrast.  I like the threatening skies, too.  A more off-center composition would have made this one better, though (IMO).  Did you get any shots of this barn close-up?  I once heard a saying, "if it''s not interesting your too far away".  while this one is nice, a closer shot, with maybe an askew perspective would have made it dynamite.', '2006-10-04 21:04:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897385, 406042, 66193, '<td valign="top">nice toning.</td>', 'nice toning.', '2006-10-04 21:04:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897386, 405350, 66193, '<td valign="top">nice use of DOF.</td>', 'nice use of DOF.', '2006-10-04 21:05:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897387, 404653, 65858, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  The only real fault I can see is that the subject isn''t exciting...  It''s not an "oh wow!" picture.  But definitely high contrast!  =)</td>', 'Nice shot.  The only real fault I can see is that the subject isn''t exciting...  It''s not an "oh wow!" picture.  But definitely high contrast!  =)', '2006-10-04 21:05:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897389, 406049, 66193, '<td valign="top">nice shot of a simple subject.  sometimes less is more.</td>', 'nice shot of a simple subject.  sometimes less is more.', '2006-10-04 21:05:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897392, 403161, 65468, '<td valign="top">Image to small to really evaluate</td>', 'Image to small to really evaluate', '2006-10-04 21:06:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897393, 403278, 65858, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure if the subject is the flowers or the sunset...  I think the flowers and grass are distracting - the sunset is beautiful!</td>', 'I''m not sure if the subject is the flowers or the sunset...  I think the flowers and grass are distracting - the sunset is beautiful!', '2006-10-04 21:06:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897396, 405922, 66193, '<td valign="top">I like the 1 to 255 title. original.  how would this work as a B&amp;W?</td>', 'I like the 1 to 255 title. original.  how would this work as a B&W?', '2006-10-04 21:06:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897400, 406034, 66193, '<td valign="top">nice capture of the mist.  Mountain looks OOF though.</td>', 'nice capture of the mist.  Mountain looks OOF though.', '2006-10-04 21:07:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897401, 404411, 65858, '<td valign="top">Good shot, nice contrast and textures.</td>', 'Good shot, nice contrast and textures.', '2006-10-04 21:07:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897407, 405410, 66193, '<td valign="top">nice perspective.  did you try at another angle instead of perfectly perpindicular to the windows?  I''d like to see those if you did.</td>', 'nice perspective.  did you try at another angle instead of perfectly perpindicular to the windows?  I''d like to see those if you did.', '2006-10-04 21:08:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897409, 403537, 65858, '<td valign="top">Definitely some good contrast.  The subject is a probably a little dull for the tastes of DPC.  =)</td>', 'Definitely some good contrast.  The subject is a probably a little dull for the tastes of DPC.  =)', '2006-10-04 21:08:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897410, 405891, 66262, '<td valign="top">Very nice contrast.</td>', 'Very nice contrast.', '2006-10-04 21:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897414, 403937, 65858, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot!  The contrast is great, the composition is appealing, and the subject is interesting to me.</td>', 'Very nice shot!  The contrast is great, the composition is appealing, and the subject is interesting to me.', '2006-10-04 21:09:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897419, 403161, 65103, '<td valign="top">it looks really good but its so small...</td>', 'it looks really good but its so small...', '2006-10-04 21:10:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897425, 404595, 65858, '<td valign="top">Crisp, clean shot.  Certainly good texture in here, though I don''t see a stark contrast.  The crop looks a little odd to me: the subject is cut off while there is empty space above.  Still, good work!</td>', 'Crisp, clean shot.  Certainly good texture in here, though I don''t see a stark contrast.  The crop looks a little odd to me: the subject is cut off while there is empty space above.  Still, good work!', '2006-10-04 21:11:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897431, 404351, 66262, '<td valign="top">I like the subject matter, but it almost seems like the contrast was pushed too far as to cause the highlights to blow out.  It seems as though it would have had a brilliant amount of contrast with just a little less brightness.  Still a good pic though I think.</td>', 'I like the subject matter, but it almost seems like the contrast was pushed too far as to cause the highlights to blow out.  It seems as though it would have had a brilliant amount of contrast with just a little less brightness.  Still a good pic though I think.', '2006-10-04 21:12:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897434, 404280, 66262, '<td valign="top">Wow, very nice.</td>', 'Wow, very nice.', '2006-10-04 21:13:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897442, 404016, 66262, '<td valign="top">My favorite.  The spiders add so much to the photo.</td>', 'My favorite.  The spiders add so much to the photo.', '2006-10-04 21:15:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897448, 405001, 66262, '<td valign="top">Very cool abstract.</td>', 'Very cool abstract.', '2006-10-04 21:16:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897449, 404204, 65468, '<td valign="top">Great composition, although the contrast is pushed for a portrait it remains a pleasing image.  I like the hair high lights</td>', 'Great composition, although the contrast is pushed for a portrait it remains a pleasing image.  I like the hair high lights', '2006-10-04 21:16:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897453, 405462, 65858, '<td valign="top">I very much like the contrast being in the subject as opposed to the actual coloration of the shot.  There seems to be a bit of an oversharp look - ie the speckles on the persons face.  As a nit, it also looks like you can see the JPEG compression (look closely for blocky/noisy regions in the black regions of the bandana.)</td>', 'I very much like the contrast being in the subject as opposed to the actual coloration of the shot.  There seems to be a bit of an oversharp look - ie the speckles on the persons face.  As a nit, it also looks like you can see the JPEG compression (look closely for blocky/noisy regions in the black regions of the bandana.)', '2006-10-04 21:17:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897466, 403673, 66262, '<td valign="top">Good composition, wonderful lighting.  Maybe a little too much emphasis on large leaves in the background, otherwise good stuff.</td>', 'Good composition, wonderful lighting.  Maybe a little too much emphasis on large leaves in the background, otherwise good stuff.', '2006-10-04 21:19:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897477, 404198, 65858, '<td valign="top">Good contrast, but a bit oversaturated for my taste.  The focus is a bit soft, but that may have been intentional.</td>', 'Good contrast, but a bit oversaturated for my taste.  The focus is a bit soft, but that may have been intentional.', '2006-10-04 21:22:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897480, 405644, 66262, '<td valign="top">Good angle, clouds seem to be slightly overexposed though.</td>', 'Good angle, clouds seem to be slightly overexposed though.', '2006-10-04 21:22:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897483, 405828, 62895, '<td valign="top">A bit to oversaturated.</td>', 'A bit to oversaturated.', '2006-10-04 21:23:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897484, 404280, 65468, '<td valign="top">Weathered wood, clouds, and surf I like the image for this challenge. Black and white makes it.</td>', 'Weathered wood, clouds, and surf I like the image for this challenge. Black and white makes it.', '2006-10-04 21:23:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897488, 403963, 62895, '<td valign="top">I''m not seeing much high contrast here.</td>', 'I''m not seeing much high contrast here.', '2006-10-04 21:24:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897492, 405708, 65468, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image and challenge entry</td>', 'Beautiful image and challenge entry', '2006-10-04 21:25:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897503, 405666, 62895, '<td valign="top">Wow...this image almost scared me when it popped up on the screen.lol. Very bright.</td>', 'Wow...this image almost scared me when it popped up on the screen.lol. Very bright.', '2006-10-04 21:26:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897506, 405538, 62895, '<td valign="top">In my opinion the background is to busy.</td>', 'In my opinion the background is to busy.', '2006-10-04 21:26:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897510, 406026, 66262, '<td valign="top">I think this effect could have been achieved with almost any photo.  Too much contrast, and overall somewhat plain subject matter. Perhaps a little less background detail would have worked better.</td>', 'I think this effect could have been achieved with almost any photo.  Too much contrast, and overall somewhat plain subject matter. Perhaps a little less background detail would have worked better.', '2006-10-04 21:28:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897512, 405350, 62895, '<td valign="top">Excellent take on the challenge. One of my favs so far.</td>', 'Excellent take on the challenge. One of my favs so far.', '2006-10-04 21:28:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897515, 403334, 62895, '<td valign="top">Good contrast, but the subject lacks some in interest.</td>', 'Good contrast, but the subject lacks some in interest.', '2006-10-04 21:29:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897516, 405974, 66262, '<td valign="top">The cross in the background is somewhat distracting, would have worked just as well or better on a flat black background.  Using a flash off to the side would improve contrast as well.</td>', 'The cross in the background is somewhat distracting, would have worked just as well or better on a flat black background.  Using a flash off to the side would improve contrast as well.', '2006-10-04 21:29:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2897518, 405134, 66262, '<td valign="top">Cool, vivid take on something we all have.</td>', 'Cool, vivid take on something we all have.', '2006-10-04 21:30:26.000000', NULL, 1),
