(2898954, 404951, 30456, '<td valign="top">This photo is just incredible.  Despite the extremes of light and dark, you were able to light the back of the subject and simultaneously capture the subtle colorations of the trees and leaves.  I hope you will share with us a little about how you were able to capture and process this shot.</td>', 'This photo is just incredible.  Despite the extremes of light and dark, you were able to light the back of the subject and simultaneously capture the subtle colorations of the trees and leaves.  I hope you will share with us a little about how you were able to capture and process this shot.', '2006-10-05 06:27:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2898956, 402515, 30456, '<td valign="top">Impressive shot.  Great angle on this.</td>', 'Impressive shot.  Great angle on this.', '2006-10-05 06:28:52.000000', NULL, 1),
