(2902838, 405099, 66490, '<td valign="top">Too bad there''s not alot of color in those clouds. I''ve seen storms with such color that makes your stomach flutter.</td>', 'Too bad there''s not alot of color in those clouds. I''ve seen storms with such color that makes your stomach flutter.', '2006-10-06 12:11:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2902841, 405125, 66490, '<td valign="top">What about a more extreme angle?</td>', 'What about a more extreme angle?', '2006-10-06 12:11:34.000000', NULL, 1),
