(2905118, 404378, 48389, '<td valign="top">I am not voting in this challenge but wanted to leave a comment...<br/> <br/>I could go into the technicals and comment on your editing (which I actually really like) but for me that''s not what this image is about. <br/> <br/>On first seeing this, without pause or thought, I burst into tears. Every part of me wishes I could wipe your tears away and stop the pain and suffering this self portrait shows. Maybe I have an advantage as I know what you look like when you smile so seeing you so openly displaying how vulnerable, hurt and sad you are here makes this all the more powerful for me.<br/> <br/>Don''t let whatever score you receive for this image take away how important it is for you Andi.</td>', 'I am not voting in this challenge but wanted to leave a comment... I could go into the technicals and comment on your editing (which I actually really like) but for me that''s not what this image is about.  On first seeing this, without pause or thought, I burst into tears. Every part of me wishes I could wipe your tears away and stop the pain and suffering this self portrait shows. Maybe I have an advantage as I know what you look like when you smile so seeing you so openly displaying how vulnerable, hurt and sad you are here makes this all the more powerful for me. Don''t let whatever score you receive for this image take away how important it is for you Andi.', '2006-10-07 06:12:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2905122, 405940, 66398, '<td valign="top">Is this Bonneville Fish Hatchery?</td>', 'Is this Bonneville Fish Hatchery?', '2006-10-07 06:15:45.000000', NULL, 1),
