(2905535, 405996, 66353, '<td valign="top">Well, if there is one thing this picture is not it''s "high contrast"</td>', 'Well, if there is one thing this picture is not it''s "high contrast"', '2006-10-07 12:18:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2905540, 403409, 66353, '<td valign="top">Nice picture - but it doesn''t meet the challenge, as it''s not "High Contrast" in any way...</td>', 'Nice picture - but it doesn''t meet the challenge, as it''s not "High Contrast" in any way...', '2006-10-07 12:20:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2905544, 404780, 66353, '<td valign="top">OK, tell me: Where is the high contrast...?</td>', 'OK, tell me: Where is the high contrast...?', '2006-10-07 12:22:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2905549, 405845, 66353, '<td valign="top">More High Key than High Contrast...</td>', 'More High Key than High Contrast...', '2006-10-07 12:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2905555, 405529, 47852, '<td valign="top">Good arrangement... slightly different from the typical arrangements done with pencils.  The lighting seems a bit harsh with the shadows.  I think just a tad less light and a bit of a levels adjustment would help this one.  Nicely done though! :)</td>', 'Good arrangement... slightly different from the typical arrangements done with pencils.  The lighting seems a bit harsh with the shadows.  I think just a tad less light and a bit of a levels adjustment would help this one.  Nicely done though! :)', '2006-10-07 12:24:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2905559, 405642, 66353, '<td valign="top">It''s a nice picture - but it doesn''t meet the challenge. There is close to no contrast in this at all</td>', 'It''s a nice picture - but it doesn''t meet the challenge. There is close to no contrast in this at all', '2006-10-07 12:26:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2905572, 404949, 66353, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot - but as it''s more in the line of "High Key" than "High Contrast", I can''t give you the rating I would have liked if this was a free study. It just doesn''t meet the challenge description...</td>', 'I like this a lot - but as it''s more in the line of "High Key" than "High Contrast", I can''t give you the rating I would have liked if this was a free study. It just doesn''t meet the challenge description...', '2006-10-07 12:29:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2905577, 404972, 47852, '<td valign="top">The coloring of this one just doesn''t work for me.  I like the contrast of dark and light, but the greenish hue is unappealing.  Perhaps a sepia tone would work better or even just a boost towards more yellow?</td>', 'The coloring of this one just doesn''t work for me.  I like the contrast of dark and light, but the greenish hue is unappealing.  Perhaps a sepia tone would work better or even just a boost towards more yellow?', '2006-10-07 12:30:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2905580, 404968, 66353, '<td valign="top">Nice picture, good lighting (not sure about the pose though) - but it does not meet the challenge. This is High Key and not High Contrast...</td>', 'Nice picture, good lighting (not sure about the pose though) - but it does not meet the challenge. This is High Key and not High Contrast...', '2006-10-07 12:31:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2905589, 404626, 47852, '<td valign="top">I love the intense look on his face.  I think a slight levels adjustment on this would have really boosted the contrast and made it stand out more.</td>', 'I love the intense look on his face.  I think a slight levels adjustment on this would have really boosted the contrast and made it stand out more.', '2006-10-07 12:34:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2905599, 405515, 47852, '<td valign="top">Clever setup... makes the viewer want to just crack open that fortune cookie to find out the rest of the fortune!  Bright part may be just a tad too bright.  Nice job!</td>', 'Clever setup... makes the viewer want to just crack open that fortune cookie to find out the rest of the fortune!  Bright part may be just a tad too bright.  Nice job!', '2006-10-07 12:39:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2905617, 406025, 60698, '<td valign="top">THis is hard to see. May need a focus adjustment or maybe it was taken from far away and cropped. Mask in shadow and the brick background is a nice idea.</td>', 'THis is hard to see. May need a focus adjustment or maybe it was taken from far away and cropped. Mask in shadow and the brick background is a nice idea.', '2006-10-07 12:47:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2905634, 405166, 47852, '<td valign="top">Priceless!  Looks like she is a wonderful and fun loving person!  The shirt really helps to tie it into the contrast challenge.  Well done!</td>', 'Priceless!  Looks like she is a wonderful and fun loving person!  The shirt really helps to tie it into the contrast challenge.  Well done!', '2006-10-07 12:50:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2905646, 404406, 47852, '<td valign="top">Stunning... this is the clear winner for the challenge in my book.  The tones, the expression.. and the reflection of the person are all perfect.  If I had to make a suggestion, I would say it looks just slightly oversharpened.  Good luck!</td>', 'Stunning... this is the clear winner for the challenge in my book.  The tones, the expression.. and the reflection of the person are all perfect.  If I had to make a suggestion, I would say it looks just slightly oversharpened.  Good luck!', '2006-10-07 12:54:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2905665, 405166, 65319, '<td valign="top">ROFL!!!!!!!!  8.</td>', 'ROFL!!!!!!!!  8.', '2006-10-07 12:59:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2905680, 405231, 65319, '<td valign="top">Hmmm...a thoughtful pose, but the ring on his finger would indicate it''s too late for second thoughts!  Good detail and the color tonality adds to the atmosphere and expression of the picture.  8.</td>', 'Hmmm...a thoughtful pose, but the ring on his finger would indicate it''s too late for second thoughts!  Good detail and the color tonality adds to the atmosphere and expression of the picture.  8.', '2006-10-07 13:04:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2905684, 405667, 65319, '<td valign="top">Wow.  That''s scary.  I bit oversharpened for me and alot of negative space on the right.  7.</td>', 'Wow.  That''s scary.  I bit oversharpened for me and alot of negative space on the right.  7.', '2006-10-07 13:06:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2905685, 405782, 65319, '<td valign="top">Hmmmm...less tongue, more eyes would have gotten a higher point from me.  6</td>', 'Hmmmm...less tongue, more eyes would have gotten a higher point from me.  6', '2006-10-07 13:07:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2905689, 405442, 65319, '<td valign="top">Nice motion shot with clear detail.  7.</td>', 'Nice motion shot with clear detail.  7.', '2006-10-07 13:07:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2905695, 405497, 65319, '<td valign="top">Those lamps in the rain with the beautiful lighting are quite elegant.</td>', 'Those lamps in the rain with the beautiful lighting are quite elegant.', '2006-10-07 13:10:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2905703, 404148, 49109, '<td valign="top">Whoa, finally a picture that meets the challenge without being overprocessed. Only some lights seem to be blown, otherwise excellent composition, sharpness, color - 9</td>', 'Whoa, finally a picture that meets the challenge without being overprocessed. Only some lights seem to be blown, otherwise excellent composition, sharpness, color - 9', '2006-10-07 13:17:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2905707, 405708, 65319, '<td valign="top">Beautiful lighting and expression.  8.</td>', 'Beautiful lighting and expression.  8.', '2006-10-07 13:20:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2905710, 402808, 65319, '<td valign="top">Would love to see the horse in the picture as well.  6.</td>', 'Would love to see the horse in the picture as well.  6.', '2006-10-07 13:21:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2905711, 403701, 65319, '<td valign="top">I love the how the detail of the feathers matches the detail in the branch!  7.</td>', 'I love the how the detail of the feathers matches the detail in the branch!  7.', '2006-10-07 13:23:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2905713, 402859, 65319, '<td valign="top">Wow.  I love the way the lighting of the lower hills leads me directly to the snowy summits. The billowy clouds give this photo a sense of balanced softness and motion in any otherwise stark setting. 9.</td>', 'Wow.  I love the way the lighting of the lower hills leads me directly to the snowy summits. The billowy clouds give this photo a sense of balanced softness and motion in any otherwise stark setting. 9.', '2006-10-07 13:25:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2905886, 404505, 20530, '<td valign="top">Interesting location. The trees in foreground don''t do much for me, though; and the whole thing feels quite tilted in an offputting way. I swear I can almost make out text in the sky. The compression artifacts detract somewhat, as well. It is definetly high contrast and a location worth revisiting.</td>', 'Interesting location. The trees in foreground don''t do much for me, though; and the whole thing feels quite tilted in an offputting way. I swear I can almost make out text in the sky. The compression artifacts detract somewhat, as well. It is definetly high contrast and a location worth revisiting.', '2006-10-07 15:15:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2905891, 405641, 20530, '<td valign="top">Stand him next to my husband if you want to see contrast! OMG, did I say that aloud? <br/> <br/>I like the lighting and off-center composition. I''m guessing there is an intentional reference to physical contrast between the lithe model and the muscular man in the framed print; or perhaps I''m reading too much into it? Regardless, I think the artwork fails to contribute enough to merit its presence in the image. IMHO, the model alone makes for a very nice image.</td>', 'Stand him next to my husband if you want to see contrast! OMG, did I say that aloud?  I like the lighting and off-center composition. I''m guessing there is an intentional reference to physical contrast between the lithe model and the muscular man in the framed print; or perhaps I''m reading too much into it? Regardless, I think the artwork fails to contribute enough to merit its presence in the image. IMHO, the model alone makes for a very nice image.', '2006-10-07 15:23:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2905892, 403373, 20530, '<td valign="top">This is one of the nicest guitar images I''ve seen in a long time. Great contrast and wonderful composition.</td>', 'This is one of the nicest guitar images I''ve seen in a long time. Great contrast and wonderful composition.', '2006-10-07 15:25:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2905899, 404016, 20530, '<td valign="top">I love the graphic nature of this image. Hopefully, the other voters are appreciating it as much as I am. I find this image to be refresing, interesting, well composed and absolutely high-contrast. Great work.</td>', 'I love the graphic nature of this image. Hopefully, the other voters are appreciating it as much as I am. I find this image to be refresing, interesting, well composed and absolutely high-contrast. Great work.', '2006-10-07 15:31:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2905907, 403598, 20530, '<td valign="top">I''ve been voting on contrast in color or light, and almost failed to recognize the technological contrasts portrayed in this image. I believe that addressing a few minor technical issues could make this a real stand-out shot. Regardless, its so interesting and makes such a statement that I can overlook those nit-picks and say that I like it very much. Nice work.</td>', 'I''ve been voting on contrast in color or light, and almost failed to recognize the technological contrasts portrayed in this image. I believe that addressing a few minor technical issues could make this a real stand-out shot. Regardless, its so interesting and makes such a statement that I can overlook those nit-picks and say that I like it very much. Nice work.', '2006-10-07 15:39:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2905912, 402603, 66597, '<td valign="top">Nice use of contrast to evoke a mood.</td>', 'Nice use of contrast to evoke a mood.', '2006-10-07 15:41:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2905917, 404952, 66597, '<td valign="top">Creepy. Effective.</td>', 'Creepy. Effective.', '2006-10-07 15:44:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2905918, 404912, 66597, '<td valign="top">This deserves a ribbon. Well done.</td>', 'This deserves a ribbon. Well done.', '2006-10-07 15:45:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2905919, 403068, 66597, '<td valign="top">Nice use of silhouette.</td>', 'Nice use of silhouette.', '2006-10-07 15:46:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2905920, 406043, 66597, '<td valign="top">Wow. Great take on an oft-photographed subject. Well done.</td>', 'Wow. Great take on an oft-photographed subject. Well done.', '2006-10-07 15:46:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2905921, 406014, 20530, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast and composition; although she''s too attractive for that much eye makeup:)</td>', 'Nice contrast and composition; although she''s too attractive for that much eye makeup:)', '2006-10-07 15:46:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2905924, 404951, 66597, '<td valign="top">Amazing use of light.</td>', 'Amazing use of light.', '2006-10-07 15:47:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2905926, 405787, 20530, '<td valign="top">Very Nice!</td>', 'Very Nice!', '2006-10-07 15:48:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2905932, 405978, 66597, '<td valign="top">Very pretty and simple.</td>', 'Very pretty and simple.', '2006-10-07 15:50:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2905934, 403759, 63970, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject - very creative.</td>', 'Interesting subject - very creative.', '2006-10-07 15:51:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2905941, 404494, 63970, '<td valign="top">Very nice take on the challenge</td>', 'Very nice take on the challenge', '2006-10-07 15:53:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2905942, 405658, 66597, '<td valign="top">I really like this. Excellent use of mundane subject. Worthy of a ribbon.</td>', 'I really like this. Excellent use of mundane subject. Worthy of a ribbon.', '2006-10-07 15:53:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2905944, 405942, 66597, '<td valign="top">I think the subtle blue highlights add to this. Nice work!</td>', 'I think the subtle blue highlights add to this. Nice work!', '2006-10-07 15:53:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2905946, 403191, 63970, '<td valign="top">Good DOF and subject.  Crop looks to be a tad tight and there is a little bit of green in the yellow of the petals that could come out.</td>', 'Good DOF and subject.  Crop looks to be a tad tight and there is a little bit of green in the yellow of the petals that could come out.', '2006-10-07 15:54:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2905950, 405322, 63970, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, cool pose for the subject.  I could have even gone for an extra 1/2 sec on the shutter.</td>', 'Nice shot, cool pose for the subject.  I could have even gone for an extra 1/2 sec on the shutter.', '2006-10-07 15:55:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2905951, 405669, 66597, '<td valign="top">Nice balance. I think this might be a bit stronger if the gloves were slightly brigher.</td>', 'Nice balance. I think this might be a bit stronger if the gloves were slightly brigher.', '2006-10-07 15:55:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2905954, 402865, 66597, '<td valign="top">The sign is beautifully lighted. The face of the lion is a little overexposed.</td>', 'The sign is beautifully lighted. The face of the lion is a little overexposed.', '2006-10-07 15:56:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2905956, 404417, 66597, '<td valign="top">This looks a little over-photoshopped to me.</td>', 'This looks a little over-photoshopped to me.', '2006-10-07 15:57:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2905959, 404134, 63970, '<td valign="top">Original picture and nice shot.  Perfect lighting.</td>', 'Original picture and nice shot.  Perfect lighting.', '2006-10-07 15:57:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2905961, 404647, 66597, '<td valign="top">Would like to see the top of the boat.</td>', 'Would like to see the top of the boat.', '2006-10-07 15:58:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2905963, 405300, 66597, '<td valign="top">Lovely light.</td>', 'Lovely light.', '2006-10-07 16:00:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2905964, 405124, 66597, '<td valign="top">This is lovely, but I''d like to see a bit more of the subject''s face (just a small bit).</td>', 'This is lovely, but I''d like to see a bit more of the subject''s face (just a small bit).', '2006-10-07 16:01:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2905968, 402503, 66597, '<td valign="top">The cropping doesn''t really work for me, even though I realize it is deliberate.</td>', 'The cropping doesn''t really work for me, even though I realize it is deliberate.', '2006-10-07 16:01:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2905971, 405641, 66597, '<td valign="top">I think the two pictures really add something to this photo. Nicely done.</td>', 'I think the two pictures really add something to this photo. Nicely done.', '2006-10-07 16:02:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2905979, 403365, 63970, '<td valign="top">Very cool shot; bold and creative.  The title tops it off.</td>', 'Very cool shot; bold and creative.  The title tops it off.', '2006-10-07 16:05:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2905980, 405791, 66597, '<td valign="top">The sunspots detract.</td>', 'The sunspots detract.', '2006-10-07 16:05:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2905982, 405611, 66597, '<td valign="top">I like how the face is cropped. It adds interest. I''m not sure about the purple hue.</td>', 'I like how the face is cropped. It adds interest. I''m not sure about the purple hue.', '2006-10-07 16:07:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2905985, 405787, 66597, '<td valign="top">I love the woman''s expression.</td>', 'I love the woman''s expression.', '2006-10-07 16:08:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2905991, 404204, 66597, '<td valign="top">The white background on the left does not look real.</td>', 'The white background on the left does not look real.', '2006-10-07 16:11:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2905996, 405388, 66597, '<td valign="top">The use of motion really adds to this. Nice.</td>', 'The use of motion really adds to this. Nice.', '2006-10-07 16:13:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2906001, 403937, 66597, '<td valign="top">Really lovely, and very natural looking.</td>', 'Really lovely, and very natural looking.', '2006-10-07 16:14:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2906003, 403658, 66597, '<td valign="top">Looks very natural, as opposed to some photos obviously photoshopped. Nice use of the mundane.</td>', 'Looks very natural, as opposed to some photos obviously photoshopped. Nice use of the mundane.', '2006-10-07 16:15:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2906005, 404928, 66597, '<td valign="top">...thankfully without the fist. Seriously, very nice lighting.</td>', '...thankfully without the fist. Seriously, very nice lighting.', '2006-10-07 16:15:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2906007, 402450, 66597, '<td valign="top">Great lighting on mundane subject (though I realize no one thinks their cat is mundane :-)</td>', 'Great lighting on mundane subject (though I realize no one thinks their cat is mundane :-)', '2006-10-07 16:16:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2906009, 405320, 66597, '<td valign="top">I really like this because it does not looked posed.</td>', 'I really like this because it does not looked posed.', '2006-10-07 16:18:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2906011, 404996, 66597, '<td valign="top">Recommend cropping rail in foreground.</td>', 'Recommend cropping rail in foreground.', '2006-10-07 16:19:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2906012, 404834, 66597, '<td valign="top">Photo is a little small on my screen. Consider enlarging?</td>', 'Photo is a little small on my screen. Consider enlarging?', '2006-10-07 16:20:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2906013, 405697, 63970, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot.  I love how the light slices through the trees, especially where it lights the shrub in the bottom right corner.  The level of detail captured here is also very impressive.  The one thing that distracts me ever so slightly is the trees in the top left of the photo.  The way they lean inward breaks up the harmony in the lines created by the radiating sun and the trees standing vertical.  Not a big deal at all.  Overall one of the most impressive shots in this challenge.  I hope this finishes well.</td>', 'Very nice shot.  I love how the light slices through the trees, especially where it lights the shrub in the bottom right corner.  The level of detail captured here is also very impressive.  The one thing that distracts me ever so slightly is the trees in the top left of the photo.  The way they lean inward breaks up the harmony in the lines created by the radiating sun and the trees standing vertical.  Not a big deal at all.  Overall one of the most impressive shots in this challenge.  I hope this finishes well.', '2006-10-07 16:20:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2906014, 405001, 20530, '<td valign="top">Nice, high-contrast abstract. Love the diagonals.</td>', 'Nice, high-contrast abstract. Love the diagonals.', '2006-10-07 16:20:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2906015, 403781, 66597, '<td valign="top">I like the colors but not the composition so much.</td>', 'I like the colors but not the composition so much.', '2006-10-07 16:20:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2906018, 405727, 66597, '<td valign="top">The simplicity is refreshing. Nicely done.</td>', 'The simplicity is refreshing. Nicely done.', '2006-10-07 16:21:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2906019, 405515, 63970, '<td valign="top">The owrd on the cookie should read "creative" as that is exactly what this shot is.  Hope this places well.</td>', 'The owrd on the cookie should read "creative" as that is exactly what this shot is.  Hope this places well.', '2006-10-07 16:22:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2906020, 405499, 66597, '<td valign="top">It is very difficult to get away with purposeful lack of focus. This works. Nicely done.</td>', 'It is very difficult to get away with purposeful lack of focus. This works. Nicely done.', '2006-10-07 16:22:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2906027, 403646, 66597, '<td valign="top">I love the motion in this photo as well as the use of high contrast.</td>', 'I love the motion in this photo as well as the use of high contrast.', '2006-10-07 16:25:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2906037, 404230, 66597, '<td valign="top">Great composition and contrast with mundane subject.</td>', 'Great composition and contrast with mundane subject.', '2006-10-07 16:29:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2906038, 405162, 40683, '<td valign="top">This is destined to take its place among the iconic images at DPC.  The best use of negative space that I''ve seen here.  Perfect! 10</td>', 'This is destined to take its place among the iconic images at DPC.  The best use of negative space that I''ve seen here.  Perfect! 10', '2006-10-07 16:29:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2906040, 405697, 66597, '<td valign="top">Fantastic use of light!</td>', 'Fantastic use of light!', '2006-10-07 16:31:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2906048, 406038, 66597, '<td valign="top">I like the use of shapes.</td>', 'I like the use of shapes.', '2006-10-07 16:34:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2906050, 404378, 66597, '<td valign="top">Very evokotive (sp?). Usually I don''t like photos with a lot of noise, but the graininess suits this and looks deliberate. Well done.</td>', 'Very evokotive (sp?). Usually I don''t like photos with a lot of noise, but the graininess suits this and looks deliberate. Well done.', '2006-10-07 16:35:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2906051, 405381, 66597, '<td valign="top">This is the best zebra photo I''ve seen in this challenge.</td>', 'This is the best zebra photo I''ve seen in this challenge.', '2006-10-07 16:35:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2906061, 404879, 60868, '<td valign="top">Nice picture... but I don''t see really a high contrast here</td>', 'Nice picture... but I don''t see really a high contrast here', '2006-10-07 16:40:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2906066, 405999, 60868, '<td valign="top">I like the expression on his face... It is interesting, the eye on the "dark" side has more light than the one on the "white" side</td>', 'I like the expression on his face... It is interesting, the eye on the "dark" side has more light than the one on the "white" side', '2006-10-07 16:42:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2906069, 405740, 60868, '<td valign="top">imo is not really a high contrast foto, but i love it</td>', 'imo is not really a high contrast foto, but i love it', '2006-10-07 16:43:42.000000', NULL, 1),
