(2908547, 404968, 66461, '<td valign="top">I would have liked this picture better if her head was turned another way, such as looking forward or away from the camera. The way it''s turned in the picture looks a little awkward and you can''t see her neck.</td>', 'I would have liked this picture better if her head was turned another way, such as looking forward or away from the camera. The way it''s turned in the picture looks a little awkward and you can''t see her neck.', '2006-10-08 17:22:36.000000', NULL, 1),
