(2911141, 406043, 50695, '<td valign="top">this hints at the dark side of Mount Rushmore. I am frankly amazed to see a new take on this subject, but you''ve accomplished it. You even include the iconic tree of the black hills. 9</td>', 'this hints at the dark side of Mount Rushmore. I am frankly amazed to see a new take on this subject, but you''ve accomplished it. You even include the iconic tree of the black hills. 9', '2006-10-09 12:04:55.000000', NULL, 1),
