(2911154, 406025, 50695, '<td valign="top">spooky, evocative, and I love the concept of the composition: Head + Shadow of Head. Or to expand the formula even further: Head(half in light, half in shadow) + Shadow of Head (which is slightly but noticeably bigger than head, a creepy metaphor for how our ideas/notions/fears become bigger than we are. 8</td>', 'spooky, evocative, and I love the concept of the composition: Head + Shadow of Head. Or to expand the formula even further: Head(half in light, half in shadow) + Shadow of Head (which is slightly but noticeably bigger than head, a creepy metaphor for how our ideas/notions/fears become bigger than we are. 8', '2006-10-09 12:07:20.000000', NULL, 1),
