(2911169, 403658, 50695, '<td valign="top">I love how everything is divided into "blocks" and in one of those blocks in the corner we find our sidewalk kid. He is new, he is news. 9</td>', 'I love how everything is divided into "blocks" and in one of those blocks in the corner we find our sidewalk kid. He is new, he is news. 9', '2006-10-09 12:10:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2911174, 403646, 50695, '<td valign="top">The three fates on the escalator of the Universe. They see the beginning and the end, can feel the motion... it is but a brief trip for them. Atropos catches our eye. We wonder if it is time for her to snip our thread. 9</td>', 'The three fates on the escalator of the Universe. They see the beginning and the end, can feel the motion... it is but a brief trip for them. Atropos catches our eye. We wonder if it is time for her to snip our thread. 9', '2006-10-09 12:12:39.000000', NULL, 1),
