(2911183, 405550, 50695, '<td valign="top">a great image for such extreme b/w. We can clearly see everything except for the main thing: the ocean... which is so big we don''t need to see it, simply because we are so sure that it''s there. This may be the best execution of the challenge. Not sure about the border, though... 9</td>', 'a great image for such extreme b/w. We can clearly see everything except for the main thing: the ocean... which is so big we don''t need to see it, simply because we are so sure that it''s there. This may be the best execution of the challenge. Not sure about the border, though... 9', '2006-10-09 12:14:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2911185, 405905, 50695, '<td valign="top">great capture! this has an oddly peaceful feel to it. I might have voted this even higher but there''s not much in the way of high contrast. 8</td>', 'great capture! this has an oddly peaceful feel to it. I might have voted this even higher but there''s not much in the way of high contrast. 8', '2006-10-09 12:15:37.000000', NULL, 1),
