(2912940, 405463, 50695, '<td valign="top">spooky, tells a story. 7 I''d give this a higher score if only it had higher contrast.</td>', 'spooky, tells a story. 7 I''d give this a higher score if only it had higher contrast.', '2006-10-09 23:46:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2912941, 405961, 50695, '<td valign="top">I love the puffery of your king. 7</td>', 'I love the puffery of your king. 7', '2006-10-09 23:46:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2912944, 405263, 50695, '<td valign="top">fascinating, mysterious still life 7</td>', 'fascinating, mysterious still life 7', '2006-10-09 23:46:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2912946, 406053, 50695, '<td valign="top">I love the crazy, colorful background more than the waterdrop-on-flower foreground. 7</td>', 'I love the crazy, colorful background more than the waterdrop-on-flower foreground. 7', '2006-10-09 23:47:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2912950, 406037, 50695, '<td valign="top">cool composition. I think your model has watched too many movies, though. I''d connect better to a real emotion. 7</td>', 'cool composition. I think your model has watched too many movies, though. I''d connect better to a real emotion. 7', '2006-10-09 23:48:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2912954, 404173, 50695, '<td valign="top">I love how the face disappears into the water. This would have been fantastic for faceless portrait. I hope you make your pictures bigger in the future. 7</td>', 'I love how the face disappears into the water. This would have been fantastic for faceless portrait. I hope you make your pictures bigger in the future. 7', '2006-10-09 23:49:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2912955, 403027, 50695, '<td valign="top">dynamic, exciting portrait with a great expresive model. 8</td>', 'dynamic, exciting portrait with a great expresive model. 8', '2006-10-09 23:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2912957, 402336, 50695, '<td valign="top">I like how rough and sparkly is the surface against which she presses. A good, emotive picture. A little creepy how her head seems detached, though. 7</td>', 'I like how rough and sparkly is the surface against which she presses. A good, emotive picture. A little creepy how her head seems detached, though. 7', '2006-10-09 23:51:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2912958, 405445, 50695, '<td valign="top">Great composition. love the impatience of your model! funny. 8</td>', 'Great composition. love the impatience of your model! funny. 8', '2006-10-09 23:51:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2912960, 403703, 20324, '<td valign="top">I like it. Nice color tones and a very nice composition. 9</td>', 'I like it. Nice color tones and a very nice composition. 9', '2006-10-09 23:52:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2912961, 405497, 50695, '<td valign="top">It seems as though light is what showers down softly upon the crowd. maybe a little too much oof, though, even for me. 7</td>', 'It seems as though light is what showers down softly upon the crowd. maybe a little too much oof, though, even for me. 7', '2006-10-09 23:52:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2912963, 405782, 50695, '<td valign="top">gotta love that attitude. 7</td>', 'gotta love that attitude. 7', '2006-10-09 23:52:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2912968, 403068, 50695, '<td valign="top">I love the crispness of the ground silhouette. It''s those weeds on the left balancing out the motorcycle that make this work for me. 7</td>', 'I love the crispness of the ground silhouette. It''s those weeds on the left balancing out the motorcycle that make this work for me. 7', '2006-10-09 23:53:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2912970, 402856, 50695, '<td valign="top">beautiful, almost-abstract landscape with level after level going backwards into a flurry of birds. 8</td>', 'beautiful, almost-abstract landscape with level after level going backwards into a flurry of birds. 8', '2006-10-09 23:54:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2912971, 402965, 50695, '<td valign="top">Great texture. 7</td>', 'Great texture. 7', '2006-10-09 23:54:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2912972, 403477, 50695, '<td valign="top">Love the lines and the color. 7</td>', 'Love the lines and the color. 7', '2006-10-09 23:54:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2912973, 404494, 50695, '<td valign="top">I like the simplicity of this and the far-reaching lines of light. Seems a little derivative of other photos, though. 7</td>', 'I like the simplicity of this and the far-reaching lines of light. Seems a little derivative of other photos, though. 7', '2006-10-09 23:55:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2912975, 405966, 50695, '<td valign="top">cool minimalistic yet noisy abstract image. This one''s gonna bomb good! but I give it an 8</td>', 'cool minimalistic yet noisy abstract image. This one''s gonna bomb good! but I give it an 8', '2006-10-09 23:56:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2912977, 402846, 50695, '<td valign="top">Good. you upped the contrast as much as you could while keeping the subject recognizable and maintaining at least the illusion of fine detail. 7</td>', 'Good. you upped the contrast as much as you could while keeping the subject recognizable and maintaining at least the illusion of fine detail. 7', '2006-10-09 23:56:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2912979, 406038, 50695, '<td valign="top">interesting assemblage of geometric shapes, good execution of challenge. 7</td>', 'interesting assemblage of geometric shapes, good execution of challenge. 7', '2006-10-09 23:57:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2912983, 405826, 50695, '<td valign="top">Staged shots should go all the way into weirdness. There should be no pretense of them being unstaged. Or they should be completely convincing as being unstaged. Too many ply some mediocre middle ground. This is just on the edge of being sufficiently weird. It''s just that dropping petals on a beautiful woman was done already in American Beauty, and this is kinda similar, though it has a more exotic flair. It''s the exotic flare, and the bold brutal highlight on the face and arm that bump this up to an 8 for me.</td>', 'Staged shots should go all the way into weirdness. There should be no pretense of them being unstaged. Or they should be completely convincing as being unstaged. Too many ply some mediocre middle ground. This is just on the edge of being sufficiently weird. It''s just that dropping petals on a beautiful woman was done already in American Beauty, and this is kinda similar, though it has a more exotic flair. It''s the exotic flare, and the bold brutal highlight on the face and arm that bump this up to an 8 for me.', '2006-10-10 00:00:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2912985, 402592, 50695, '<td valign="top">I feel an intimate connection with those geese. 7</td>', 'I feel an intimate connection with those geese. 7', '2006-10-10 00:00:53.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2912986, 405810, 50695, '<td valign="top">Molly is very expressive, and I sense an energy, like she''s pawing the camera. 7</td>', 'Molly is very expressive, and I sense an energy, like she''s pawing the camera. 7', '2006-10-10 00:01:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2912988, 404353, 50695, '<td valign="top">great capture. 7</td>', 'great capture. 7', '2006-10-10 00:01:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2912989, 405306, 50695, '<td valign="top">no distracting elements, this is purely iconic/symbolic. 7</td>', 'no distracting elements, this is purely iconic/symbolic. 7', '2006-10-10 00:01:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2912990, 405996, 50695, '<td valign="top">dof creates a freaky floating effect. that''s a good thing. 7</td>', 'dof creates a freaky floating effect. that''s a good thing. 7', '2006-10-10 00:02:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2913009, 405436, 50695, '<td valign="top">good capture. I like how the too-near sun has turned the bird into a shadow... or maybe that is a picture of a shadow! No, I don''t think so. It''s great to be made to wonder, though. Not crazy about the crop, though. It''s a fine line, but make the crop too extreme and it calls attention to itself. 7</td>', 'good capture. I like how the too-near sun has turned the bird into a shadow... or maybe that is a picture of a shadow! No, I don''t think so. It''s great to be made to wonder, though. Not crazy about the crop, though. It''s a fine line, but make the crop too extreme and it calls attention to itself. 7', '2006-10-10 00:12:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2913011, 403819, 50695, '<td valign="top">this really pops! but also I love the boat/reflection silhouettes. plus a pleasing composition. 7</td>', 'this really pops! but also I love the boat/reflection silhouettes. plus a pleasing composition. 7', '2006-10-10 00:12:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2913013, 405515, 50695, '<td valign="top">I love the words you discovered. decent composition, too. 7</td>', 'I love the words you discovered. decent composition, too. 7', '2006-10-10 00:13:28.000000', NULL, 1),
