(2914322, 403281, 66515, '<td valign="top">Excellent work. Some of the leaves in the bottom left of the group are a little bit blurry but I really like the contrast of colours</td>', 'Excellent work. Some of the leaves in the bottom left of the group are a little bit blurry but I really like the contrast of colours', '2006-10-10 14:12:03.000000', NULL, 1),
