(2914599, 403862, 56730, '<td valign="top">neat shot</td>', 'neat shot', '2006-10-10 16:18:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2914600, 405894, 56730, '<td valign="top">I like the composition, not sure I like the processing.</td>', 'I like the composition, not sure I like the processing.', '2006-10-10 16:18:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2914603, 402829, 66575, '<td valign="top">this is really really pretty. . .but the positioning of the fingers kind of threw me.</td>', 'this is really really pretty. . .but the positioning of the fingers kind of threw me.', '2006-10-10 16:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2914604, 405509, 66575, '<td valign="top">too high!</td>', 'too high!', '2006-10-10 16:20:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2914605, 402859, 56730, '<td valign="top">love this photo!</td>', 'love this photo!', '2006-10-10 16:21:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2914608, 405722, 66193, '<td valign="top">composition could be made a little more interesting by moving the flower from dead center of the frame.</td>', 'composition could be made a little more interesting by moving the flower from dead center of the frame.', '2006-10-10 16:22:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2914609, 404882, 66575, '<td valign="top">with such a dynamic subject i wanted to see everthing more clearly.  it''s just too soft.</td>', 'with such a dynamic subject i wanted to see everthing more clearly.  it''s just too soft.', '2006-10-10 16:22:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2914612, 404792, 66193, '<td valign="top">nice image.  Did you try cropping a little more off the bottom, so that the horizon is not centered vertically.  Keep the interesting horizon, and the wonderful colors of the sky (removing the boring black stuff)</td>', 'nice image.  Did you try cropping a little more off the bottom, so that the horizon is not centered vertically.  Keep the interesting horizon, and the wonderful colors of the sky (removing the boring black stuff)', '2006-10-10 16:24:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2914614, 405306, 66575, '<td valign="top">10!  just wish the sail were whiter. . .</td>', '10!  just wish the sail were whiter. . .', '2006-10-10 16:25:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2914616, 405300, 66193, '<td valign="top">a little too saturated for my tastes.  looks unnaturally blue, instead of the threatening grays that I usually see.</td>', 'a little too saturated for my tastes.  looks unnaturally blue, instead of the threatening grays that I usually see.', '2006-10-10 16:25:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2914618, 404180, 66193, '<td valign="top">looks like a lot of mid-tones.  not very contrasty.</td>', 'looks like a lot of mid-tones.  not very contrasty.', '2006-10-10 16:26:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2914620, 405532, 66193, '<td valign="top">an interesting take on high contrast (green leaf vs dying one)</td>', 'an interesting take on high contrast (green leaf vs dying one)', '2006-10-10 16:26:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2914623, 405771, 66193, '<td valign="top">nice textures.</td>', 'nice textures.', '2006-10-10 16:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2914627, 403709, 66193, '<td valign="top">looks a little OOF throughout</td>', 'looks a little OOF throughout', '2006-10-10 16:28:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2914629, 404751, 66193, '<td valign="top">nice composition.  still has details in the shadows (a good thing)</td>', 'nice composition.  still has details in the shadows (a good thing)', '2006-10-10 16:28:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2914633, 405155, 66193, '<td valign="top">nice conversion to b&amp;w</td>', 'nice conversion to b&w', '2006-10-10 16:29:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2914641, 405904, 66193, '<td valign="top">not quite enough DOF.  The nose looks OOF, and it''s kind of distraction.  The leg appears to be most in focus.</td>', 'not quite enough DOF.  The nose looks OOF, and it''s kind of distraction.  The leg appears to be most in focus.', '2006-10-10 16:30:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2914642, 404280, 66193, '<td valign="top">I like the way you waited for the wave to come up through the fence, leaving the foamy surf to contrast with the dark tones of the fence and sand.</td>', 'I like the way you waited for the wave to come up through the fence, leaving the foamy surf to contrast with the dark tones of the fence and sand.', '2006-10-10 16:31:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2914644, 405708, 66193, '<td valign="top">nice portrait.  I would imagine that she would love to have this printed up for her.</td>', 'nice portrait.  I would imagine that she would love to have this printed up for her.', '2006-10-10 16:32:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2914647, 406026, 66193, '<td valign="top">certainly high contrast.  too much in my opinion.  it should be more than photoshop work that gets you to meet the challenge</td>', 'certainly high contrast.  too much in my opinion.  it should be more than photoshop work that gets you to meet the challenge', '2006-10-10 16:33:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2914649, 405542, 66193, '<td valign="top">a slightly different perspective to remove most of the sky would have given you a more powerful composition.  I like the rest of the photo, however.  nicely done.</td>', 'a slightly different perspective to remove most of the sky would have given you a more powerful composition.  I like the rest of the photo, however.  nicely done.', '2006-10-10 16:34:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2914652, 405381, 66193, '<td valign="top">too cliche for me.  I like the way the stripes are aligned, though (diagonally, which is usually a very interesting orientation)</td>', 'too cliche for me.  I like the way the stripes are aligned, though (diagonally, which is usually a very interesting orientation)', '2006-10-10 16:34:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2914654, 405463, 66193, '<td valign="top">crop out most of the sky, and your image gets better.  in its current form, the horizon is too centered, and the blown out sky is too distracting.</td>', 'crop out most of the sky, and your image gets better.  in its current form, the horizon is too centered, and the blown out sky is too distracting.', '2006-10-10 16:35:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2914656, 403789, 66193, '<td valign="top">could have used more DOF.  having the entire lime surface in focus so we could see the texture would have been very nice.</td>', 'could have used more DOF.  having the entire lime surface in focus so we could see the texture would have been very nice.', '2006-10-10 16:36:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2914658, 402988, 66193, '<td valign="top">nice contrast.  very nicely done.  I''m starting to be able to pick out certain photographers from these photos!</td>', 'nice contrast.  very nicely done.  I''m starting to be able to pick out certain photographers from these photos!', '2006-10-10 16:37:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2914668, 404471, 66193, '<td valign="top">IMO, a sunset is a difficult subject to get right.  Usually, the colors can help rescue a shot, but often times we rely on those colors too much.  I think this is the case here.  The horizon is too centered vertically, and there''s not much interesting happening in the clouds (at the mercy of the weather!).  I think the foreground could have been interesting, but it''s very hard to tell with the contrast so high (too high).  And finally, the sun is smack dab in the middle of the frame.  Again, a boring composition.  Not trying to mean, just give some helpful hints.  Hope it was helpful.</td>', 'IMO, a sunset is a difficult subject to get right.  Usually, the colors can help rescue a shot, but often times we rely on those colors too much.  I think this is the case here.  The horizon is too centered vertically, and there''s not much interesting happening in the clouds (at the mercy of the weather!).  I think the foreground could have been interesting, but it''s very hard to tell with the contrast so high (too high).  And finally, the sun is smack dab in the middle of the frame.  Again, a boring composition.  Not trying to mean, just give some helpful hints.  Hope it was helpful.', '2006-10-10 16:41:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2914674, 405658, 66193, '<td valign="top">I like this one very much.  The contrasting red text with the rest of the frame is very catching.  I''d be interested to know how you got that texture into the bricks and door.  very dynamic composition too.  gave it a 9.</td>', 'I like this one very much.  The contrasting red text with the rest of the frame is very catching.  I''d be interested to know how you got that texture into the bricks and door.  very dynamic composition too.  gave it a 9.', '2006-10-10 16:42:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2914676, 405550, 66193, '<td valign="top">too contrasty IMO.  high contrast should be more than pure black and pure white.</td>', 'too contrasty IMO.  high contrast should be more than pure black and pure white.', '2006-10-10 16:43:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2914680, 405233, 66193, '<td valign="top">a couple of comments on composition: there is a lot going on in this capture.  My eyes don''t know where to focus.  Try to simplify the compositions.  If the background shore was beyond the DOF, that would''ve helped.  Also, make sure the foreground elements are in focus (unless of course they are way out of focus).  Having them almost in focus is distracting.</td>', 'a couple of comments on composition: there is a lot going on in this capture.  My eyes don''t know where to focus.  Try to simplify the compositions.  If the background shore was beyond the DOF, that would''ve helped.  Also, make sure the foreground elements are in focus (unless of course they are way out of focus).  Having them almost in focus is distracting.', '2006-10-10 16:45:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2914681, 405965, 66193, '<td valign="top">I like this one.  having the person on the steps adds some humanity to the cold, harsh building. gave it an 8.</td>', 'I like this one.  having the person on the steps adds some humanity to the cold, harsh building. gave it an 8.', '2006-10-10 16:46:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2914682, 405118, 66193, '<td valign="top">a little too much empty space for my tastes.  I like the shot other than that though.</td>', 'a little too much empty space for my tastes.  I like the shot other than that though.', '2006-10-10 16:47:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2914688, 404399, 66193, '<td valign="top">interesting composition.  not sure about the coloring choice.  also seems not very contrasty (most of the frame is filled with mid-tones)</td>', 'interesting composition.  not sure about the coloring choice.  also seems not very contrasty (most of the frame is filled with mid-tones)', '2006-10-10 16:50:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2914691, 404951, 66193, '<td valign="top">I like the execution on this one. composition is nice. not just a capture of blown out highlights and indistinguishable shadows.  good job. 8</td>', 'I like the execution on this one. composition is nice. not just a capture of blown out highlights and indistinguishable shadows.  good job. 8', '2006-10-10 16:51:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2914692, 403649, 66193, '<td valign="top">nice composition</td>', 'nice composition', '2006-10-10 16:51:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2914695, 404365, 66193, '<td valign="top">too centered.  Nice DOF, though.</td>', 'too centered.  Nice DOF, though.', '2006-10-10 16:51:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2914701, 405642, 66193, '<td valign="top">not high contrast, IMO.  not very exciting composition</td>', 'not high contrast, IMO.  not very exciting composition', '2006-10-10 16:52:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2914709, 403726, 66193, '<td valign="top">besides the pumped up contrast that is overdone, this shot had potential.  Cropping tighter on these shots is always good (get ride of the partial players on the right).  Nice angle (it''s obvious you were down on the ground, allowing us to see the youngsters'' faces).  too bad the ref got in the frame.</td>', 'besides the pumped up contrast that is overdone, this shot had potential.  Cropping tighter on these shots is always good (get ride of the partial players on the right).  Nice angle (it''s obvious you were down on the ground, allowing us to see the youngsters'' faces).  too bad the ref got in the frame.', '2006-10-10 16:54:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2914711, 402503, 66193, '<td valign="top">very nice composition.  I like the askew horizon (how many comments did you get asking you to straighten it?!)  nice lighting, too.</td>', 'very nice composition.  I like the askew horizon (how many comments did you get asking you to straighten it?!)  nice lighting, too.', '2006-10-10 16:55:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2914716, 405845, 36199, '<td valign="top">A very good baby photo</td>', 'A very good baby photo', '2006-10-10 16:57:11.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2914717, 402965, 66193, '<td valign="top">certainly meets the challenge of high contrast (you''ve done it nicely).  would have been a winner if the composition was a little more interesting, though.  IMO, it''s too centered in the frame.  get creative and shoot this subject for about 50 frames, trying all different angles.  I bet you come up with one that just pops.</td>', 'certainly meets the challenge of high contrast (you''ve done it nicely).  would have been a winner if the composition was a little more interesting, though.  IMO, it''s too centered in the frame.  get creative and shoot this subject for about 50 frames, trying all different angles.  I bet you come up with one that just pops.', '2006-10-10 16:57:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2914723, 404877, 66193, '<td valign="top">I would have liked to have seen the horn player in the frame by himself.  that would have been a killer shot, with that lighting!</td>', 'I would have liked to have seen the horn player in the frame by himself.  that would have been a killer shot, with that lighting!', '2006-10-10 16:58:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2914727, 405031, 36199, '<td valign="top">Would be really good as an abstract as well</td>', 'Would be really good as an abstract as well', '2006-10-10 16:58:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2914729, 404280, 36199, '<td valign="top">Beautiful</td>', 'Beautiful', '2006-10-10 16:58:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2914731, 405954, 66193, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure how I like the selective focus being so far on the left of the frame (my eyes are drawn to the black keys, and the only one in focus is the one on the left).  Interesting composition otherwise, though.  a 7 for now.</td>', 'I''m not sure how I like the selective focus being so far on the left of the frame (my eyes are drawn to the black keys, and the only one in focus is the one on the left).  Interesting composition otherwise, though.  a 7 for now.', '2006-10-10 16:59:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2914733, 406048, 66193, '<td valign="top">I like this one.  the only nitpick is the distracting white object in the background (over his right shoulder).</td>', 'I like this one.  the only nitpick is the distracting white object in the background (over his right shoulder).', '2006-10-10 16:59:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2914736, 405442, 66193, '<td valign="top">like the long exposure here.</td>', 'like the long exposure here.', '2006-10-10 17:00:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2914741, 405512, 36199, '<td valign="top">The colours in the water are really beautiful</td>', 'The colours in the water are really beautiful', '2006-10-10 17:01:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2914744, 404161, 66193, '<td valign="top">love the coloring on this one.  would have been a 10 if cropped more interestingly. try cropping so that the dark green leaves on the top are close to the right of the frame (without adding any more space to the right).  this would give you a unique aspect ratio, maybe almost a portrait instead of landscape orientation.</td>', 'love the coloring on this one.  would have been a 10 if cropped more interestingly. try cropping so that the dark green leaves on the top are close to the right of the frame (without adding any more space to the right).  this would give you a unique aspect ratio, maybe almost a portrait instead of landscape orientation.', '2006-10-10 17:02:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2914745, 402592, 66193, '<td valign="top">interesting cloud formations</td>', 'interesting cloud formations', '2006-10-10 17:02:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2914748, 405794, 66193, '<td valign="top">it all seems out of focus to me.</td>', 'it all seems out of focus to me.', '2006-10-10 17:03:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2914751, 404686, 36199, '<td valign="top">Fantastic reflections</td>', 'Fantastic reflections', '2006-10-10 17:04:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2914752, 402765, 66193, '<td valign="top">certainly a different composition attempt. not sure if I like it though.  I think what''s distracting my eye is the dark stuff if the upper left corner.</td>', 'certainly a different composition attempt. not sure if I like it though.  I think what''s distracting my eye is the dark stuff if the upper left corner.', '2006-10-10 17:04:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2914755, 404641, 66193, '<td valign="top">post processing seems overdone to me.  would have been nicer with a lighter touch on the sliders.  also a more vintage lantern would have worked well, too.</td>', 'post processing seems overdone to me.  would have been nicer with a lighter touch on the sliders.  also a more vintage lantern would have worked well, too.', '2006-10-10 17:05:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2914759, 403825, 66193, '<td valign="top">would have liked to see the girl in the frame by herself.  the violinist in the background is distracting.</td>', 'would have liked to see the girl in the frame by herself.  the violinist in the background is distracting.', '2006-10-10 17:06:02.000000', NULL, 1),
