(2915702, 403278, 64933, '<td valign="top">I love this photograph. The sun and clouds balance perfectly with the tall grass on the other side. It would have made it better if you didn''t use a flash or whatever you did. It makes the flowers stand out too much because the light on them doesn''t match that of the sun.</td>', 'I love this photograph. The sun and clouds balance perfectly with the tall grass on the other side. It would have made it better if you didn''t use a flash or whatever you did. It makes the flowers stand out too much because the light on them doesn''t match that of the sun.', '2006-10-10 22:40:07.000000', NULL, 1),
