(2917768, 405667, 36619, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by posthumous:</b></div><hr/><i> I really do want to hear about how you created this image. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>most of the weird-ness was created by channel mixer, i didn''t write it down but it was low, low red, mid-green &amp; high, high blue. i was really just experimenting with mixer when i got this.<br/></td>', 'Originally posted by posthumous: I really do want to hear about how you created this image.   most of the weird-ness was created by channel mixer, i didn''t write it down but it was low, low red, mid-green & high, high blue. i was really just experimenting with mixer when i got this.', '2006-10-11 11:15:52.000000', NULL, 0),
