(2917833, 405974, 61559, '<td valign="top">I think using a tripod would have helped. Slowing down the shutter speed would get you an f-stop that would have all of the subject (the white statue) in focus. I''d leave the wooden cross out.</td>', 'I think using a tripod would have helped. Slowing down the shutter speed would get you an f-stop that would have all of the subject (the white statue) in focus. I''d leave the wooden cross out.', '2006-10-11 11:33:16.000000', NULL, 0),
