(2917873, 405667, 50695, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by chele:</b></div><hr/><i>most of the weird-ness was created by channel mixer, i didn''t write it down but it was low, low red, mid-green &amp; high, high blue. i was really just experimenting with mixer when i got this. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I have noticed some weird effects with channel mixer. I''ll have to expore that more!</td>', 'Originally posted by chele:most of the weird-ness was created by channel mixer, i didn''t write it down but it was low, low red, mid-green & high, high blue. i was really just experimenting with mixer when i got this.   I have noticed some weird effects with channel mixer. I''ll have to expore that more!', '2006-10-11 11:42:53.000000', NULL, 0),
