(2917994, 405708, 7778, '<td valign="top">The ''Diffuse Glow'' effect is subtle enough, and probably <i>alters</i> the image less than sharpening. To me, the DQ takes nothing away, neither ranking nor honour. Like everyone else, I respect the rules for the purpose they serve. Here their interpretation interferes with my perception of what''s natural and appropriate.</td>', 'The ''Diffuse Glow'' effect is subtle enough, and probably alters the image less than sharpening. To me, the DQ takes nothing away, neither ranking nor honour. Like everyone else, I respect the rules for the purpose they serve. Here their interpretation interferes with my perception of what''s natural and appropriate.', '2006-10-11 12:20:09.000000', NULL, 0),
