(2918112, 406044, 5354, '<td valign="top">Saw the spidy, but voted 4.<br/>Doesn''t say contrast to me at all. Lighting is not particularly impressive, flower is not the best specimen. Nothing here to make me want to vote higher to be honest.<br/> <br/>Hich contrast is about light and dark, about zap, about black and white, about juxtapostion of colour.<br/> <br/>Probably need to rethink the approach.</td>', 'Saw the spidy, but voted 4.Doesn''t say contrast to me at all. Lighting is not particularly impressive, flower is not the best specimen. Nothing here to make me want to vote higher to be honest. Hich contrast is about light and dark, about zap, about black and white, about juxtapostion of colour. Probably need to rethink the approach.', '2006-10-11 12:58:59.000000', NULL, 0),
