(2918591, 406056, 54747, '<td valign="top">Actually, I beat a hasty retreat when the thing jumped into the lens.  Turns out that the giant house spider is the second fastest spider in the world, according to Guinness (it can run up to 1.5mph).<br/> <br/>She is still alive, and living in my garage, killing all the other spiders. :)</td>', 'Actually, I beat a hasty retreat when the thing jumped into the lens.  Turns out that the giant house spider is the second fastest spider in the world, according to Guinness (it can run up to 1.5mph). She is still alive, and living in my garage, killing all the other spiders. :)', '2006-10-11 14:27:11.000000', NULL, 0),
