(2919503, 404280, 63970, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Falc:</b></div><hr/><i> Self DQ Requested.<br/> <br/>I just realised I used an illegal basic editing technique to convert to B/w. I used 2 layers of Hue/Sat, the bottom one in Hue Blend mode.<br/> <br/>I apologise for this error and request a self DQ </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>May everyone at DPC share in your honesty.  I am sad to see you lose out on fourth place, but the image is stunning nonetheless.  Keep up the good work!</td>', 'Originally posted by Falc: Self DQ Requested. I just realised I used an illegal basic editing technique to convert to B/w. I used 2 layers of Hue/Sat, the bottom one in Hue Blend mode. I apologise for this error and request a self DQ   May everyone at DPC share in your honesty.  I am sad to see you lose out on fourth place, but the image is stunning nonetheless.  Keep up the good work!', '2006-10-11 17:43:55.000000', NULL, 0),
