(2919788, 406026, 5792, '<td valign="top">This picture is an excellent example of high contrast imagery. You did the job right and don''t think different for one instant based on your score. Scores like yours make me shake my head at DPC voters. I gave you that ''10'' and I''d defend that rating to anyone that questioned it.</td>', 'This picture is an excellent example of high contrast imagery. You did the job right and don''t think different for one instant based on your score. Scores like yours make me shake my head at DPC voters. I gave you that ''10'' and I''d defend that rating to anyone that questioned it.', '2006-10-11 18:44:22.000000', NULL, 0),
