(2919939, 405118, 65603, '<td valign="top">Well I scored this one a 10 and am very sad to see it didn''t make it to the top 10. The contrast is great the proprtions are awesome. The shot is playful.  Thumbs up !!!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-10-12 10:41:36.</i></td>', 'Well I scored this one a 10 and am very sad to see it didn''t make it to the top 10. The contrast is great the proprtions are awesome. The shot is playful.  Thumbs up !!!', '2006-10-11 19:12:45.000000', '2006-10-12 11:41:36.000000', 0),
(2919971, 403281, 811, '<td valign="top">I really like the off centered composition.  I think it add dynamics to the shot and interest.  Also, I love the contrast between the blue and yellow.  There'' something kinda odd about the leaves to me though.  It looks like they are lying flat instead of on a tree like you would "feel" like they should be.</td>', 'I really like the off centered composition.  I think it add dynamics to the shot and interest.  Also, I love the contrast between the blue and yellow.  There'' something kinda odd about the leaves to me though.  It looks like they are lying flat instead of on a tree like you would "feel" like they should be.', '2006-10-11 19:21:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(2919975, 405828, 811, '<td valign="top">Wow, this hurts my eyes as if I was actually watching a welder.  I think you have done a good job on the exposure.  The fact that you can actually see details on his mask and it is not too dark is impressive to me.  <br/> <br/>I honestly don''t know why this didn''t score a lot higher, but then, c''est la vie.</td>', 'Wow, this hurts my eyes as if I was actually watching a welder.  I think you have done a good job on the exposure.  The fact that you can actually see details on his mask and it is not too dark is impressive to me.   I honestly don''t know why this didn''t score a lot higher, but then, c''est la vie.', '2006-10-11 19:23:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(2919978, 405892, 811, '<td valign="top">I tend to like compositions that are "full" of repeating patterns like this.  Your colors are very nice.  The gray tones in the upper left are distracting for me.</td>', 'I tend to like compositions that are "full" of repeating patterns like this.  Your colors are very nice.  The gray tones in the upper left are distracting for me.', '2006-10-11 19:24:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(2919982, 405712, 811, '<td valign="top">Good use of leading lines.  I''m wondering if it is a bit too much "gray" and you could have gotten by with even more contrast.</td>', 'Good use of leading lines.  I''m wondering if it is a bit too much "gray" and you could have gotten by with even more contrast.', '2006-10-11 19:25:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(2919988, 406026, 811, '<td valign="top">The composition is strong and solid.  It is definitely "contrasty," but I imagine it simply didn''t appeal, visually, to many.  It''s almost as if by eliminating all of the middle tones, the emotion or story of the shot is gone as well.  I think if you could have achieved the contrast without so much obvious photoshop it would have been better.</td>', 'The composition is strong and solid.  It is definitely "contrasty," but I imagine it simply didn''t appeal, visually, to many.  It''s almost as if by eliminating all of the middle tones, the emotion or story of the shot is gone as well.  I think if you could have achieved the contrast without so much obvious photoshop it would have been better.', '2006-10-11 19:27:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(2920004, 403746, 66193, '<td valign="top">Thanks to everyone who voted and commented on this image.  It was nice to see that others liked the photo as much as I did.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-10-11 21:56:06.</i></td>', 'Thanks to everyone who voted and commented on this image.  It was nice to see that others liked the photo as much as I did.', '2006-10-11 19:34:29.000000', '2006-10-11 22:56:06.000000', 0),
(2920008, 406044, 29748, '<td valign="top">I saw the spider, still voted it a 5.  The spider really did not contrast, and the flower was very wilted.  would not change my vote.</td>', 'I saw the spider, still voted it a 5.  The spider really did not contrast, and the flower was very wilted.  would not change my vote.', '2006-10-11 19:35:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(2920033, 405974, 44453, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Falc:</b></div><hr/><i>So my guess is you managed to hit just about every OFF button at DPC. The only other ones you missed were pets and kids ;-)<br/> <br/>Sad but true I''m afraid. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>And the American Flag tends to get voted down pretty quickly as well</td>', 'Originally posted by Falc:So my guess is you managed to hit just about every OFF button at DPC. The only other ones you missed were pets and kids ;-) Sad but true I''m afraid.   And the American Flag tends to get voted down pretty quickly as well', '2006-10-11 19:43:22.000000', NULL, 0),
