(2920234, 406038, 30982, '<td valign="top">Excellent!  I really liked this in the challenge alot - and agree with the other commenters that even though it got a 6+ score, it should have done better in this challenge.  I like how parts fade to black and that there are few if any "mid" tones - just the stark contrasts of black and white.  Great use of sort of midday sun, too!</td>', 'Excellent!  I really liked this in the challenge alot - and agree with the other commenters that even though it got a 6+ score, it should have done better in this challenge.  I like how parts fade to black and that there are few if any "mid" tones - just the stark contrasts of black and white.  Great use of sort of midday sun, too!', '2006-10-11 20:57:30.000000', NULL, 0),
