(2921016, 404546, 53147, '<td valign="top">If I had known these were my models I probably would have bumpe it up one. I love these cats and the pics that come from them. I gave youa 6 on this in challenge. A little on the soft side but I understand the struggles here. Probably not as contrasty as the DPC voters would hav eliked but a nice shot none the less. Let me know when you are in town again and we can do a mini DPC GTG.</td>', 'If I had known these were my models I probably would have bumpe it up one. I love these cats and the pics that come from them. I gave youa 6 on this in challenge. A little on the soft side but I understand the struggles here. Probably not as contrasty as the DPC voters would hav eliked but a nice shot none the less. Let me know when you are in town again and we can do a mini DPC GTG.', '2006-10-12 00:40:26.000000', NULL, 0),
