(2924308, 405916, 32997, '<td valign="top">dull...:)<br/> <br/>secretly think the shadow is cool, makes me think of a Teddy Bear...<br/>reminds me of when I took a Pet Portrait shot...my dog too is black...no matter what I do I can''t succeed in really getting a shot of her that really captures everythig about her like I can with my kids...and that is what I see here, or rather don''t see...the dog, but with even the contrast you have, I don''t get to know her...ok when I have more time I am going to venture through some of your pet shots and learn from you, because I think with the one I looked at through the window, you were on to something...<br/> <br/>crap I couldn''t just stick to dull...</td>', 'dull...:) secretly think the shadow is cool, makes me think of a Teddy Bear...reminds me of when I took a Pet Portrait shot...my dog too is black...no matter what I do I can''t succeed in really getting a shot of her that really captures everythig about her like I can with my kids...and that is what I see here, or rather don''t see...the dog, but with even the contrast you have, I don''t get to know her...ok when I have more time I am going to venture through some of your pet shots and learn from you, because I think with the one I looked at through the window, you were on to something... crap I couldn''t just stick to dull...', '2006-10-12 23:39:24.000000', NULL, 0),
