(2926883, 405712, 55838, '<td valign="top">This is definetly a contrasty image - it''s just that the subject matter doesn''t jump out and grab my interest as a viewer...but whacha gonna do?  Can''t please everyone all the time!  ; )<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-10-13 19:52:52.</i></td>', 'This is definetly a contrasty image - it''s just that the subject matter doesn''t jump out and grab my interest as a viewer...but whacha gonna do?  Can''t please everyone all the time!  ; )', '2006-10-13 20:49:06.000000', '2006-10-13 20:52:52.000000', 0),
(2926886, 406029, 55838, '<td valign="top">What a cool flower!  Looks like fire.  Lovely contrasting colors.  Nice crop.  I think my eyes would prefer a little tighter focus on at least the very center of the flower.</td>', 'What a cool flower!  Looks like fire.  Lovely contrasting colors.  Nice crop.  I think my eyes would prefer a little tighter focus on at least the very center of the flower.', '2006-10-13 20:51:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(2926911, 406026, 55838, '<td valign="top">Whoa....4.8 was a bit harsh for this shot IMO.  I voted it 6 during the challenge - I thought it was a cool shot but a bit too overdone giving it a cartoon feel.  Now that I''m looking at it again in preparation for this comment, I''m attracted to the shot more...oddly BECAUSE of the clean cartoon feel.  If I were voting again it would be 7 (not exactly a huge help now eh?!).  Sorry.  I like that you took a chance and went all the way on this...just like an artist should.</td>', 'Whoa....4.8 was a bit harsh for this shot IMO.  I voted it 6 during the challenge - I thought it was a cool shot but a bit too overdone giving it a cartoon feel.  Now that I''m looking at it again in preparation for this comment, I''m attracted to the shot more...oddly BECAUSE of the clean cartoon feel.  If I were voting again it would be 7 (not exactly a huge help now eh?!).  Sorry.  I like that you took a chance and went all the way on this...just like an artist should.', '2006-10-13 20:59:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(2927457, 405828, 45475, '<td valign="top">Over saturating the colours is really what has given this the edge here. I thought it was a great entry. Had I voted, I would have given it a 7. Cool lens flare on the upper left too!</td>', 'Over saturating the colours is really what has given this the edge here. I thought it was a great entry. Had I voted, I would have given it a 7. Cool lens flare on the upper left too!', '2006-10-14 00:33:07.000000', NULL, 0),
