(2928092, 406012, 11854, '<td valign="top">I''m not a good judge of contrast. That''s why I didn''t enter this one. It''s funny, you wrote in a thread that I said it was boring. (It was Kirsty). The sky seems really flat and it seems you only have light on a very small portion of one building.</td>', 'I''m not a good judge of contrast. That''s why I didn''t enter this one. It''s funny, you wrote in a thread that I said it was boring. (It was Kirsty). The sky seems really flat and it seems you only have light on a very small portion of one building.', '2006-10-14 10:56:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(2928119, 402450, 11854, '<td valign="top">Ahh, so you had one of the dreaded cat shots that people were b*tching about. Very nicely done. I didn''t vote in this challenge either because I never can seem to get what makes high contrast. So disregarding that factor, it''s a lovely shot with beautiful lighting. What is hanging out of his/her mouth though?</td>', 'Ahh, so you had one of the dreaded cat shots that people were b*tching about. Very nicely done. I didn''t vote in this challenge either because I never can seem to get what makes high contrast. So disregarding that factor, it''s a lovely shot with beautiful lighting. What is hanging out of his/her mouth though?', '2006-10-14 11:14:16.000000', NULL, 0),
