(2929430, 405118, 51638, '<td valign="top">You woz robbed! 6.16 is good, but this deserved better. The only thing I might have changed (and it''s a very small thing) is having your model barefoot. I just think it would have suited the pic better. Well done though.</td>', 'You woz robbed! 6.16 is good, but this deserved better. The only thing I might have changed (and it''s a very small thing) is having your model barefoot. I just think it would have suited the pic better. Well done though.', '2006-10-15 01:25:07.000000', NULL, 0),
