(3169602, 404378, 48389, '<td valign="top">Until now I have found this image too difficult to revisit but, today, I wanted to return to leave you this message:<br/> <br/>You showed such courage in submitting this shot and for me that sums you up. This past 7+ months you have had more to bear than any Father ever should but throughout you have shown great strength and I am so proud of you.<br/> <br/>You have allowed me, DPC and all that know you to see your love for Rose and through you we have been able to get to know your beautiful girl. She will remain in my heart always.<br/> <br/>Even with all you have and still are facing you have managed to be there for me and words are just not enough to show how grateful I am to you for this.<br/> <br/>So Andi, whatever life brings in the days, weeks and months to come I just want to remind you to take time out for YOU, hold on to your happy memories and don''t be afraid to cry.<br/> <br/>I am always here for you, Love you XxX<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-01-02 19:00:53.</i></td>', 'Until now I have found this image too difficult to revisit but, today, I wanted to return to leave you this message: You showed such courage in submitting this shot and for me that sums you up. This past 7+ months you have had more to bear than any Father ever should but throughout you have shown great strength and I am so proud of you. You have allowed me, DPC and all that know you to see your love for Rose and through you we have been able to get to know your beautiful girl. She will remain in my heart always. Even with all you have and still are facing you have managed to be there for me and words are just not enough to show how grateful I am to you for this. So Andi, whatever life brings in the days, weeks and months to come I just want to remind you to take time out for YOU, hold on to your happy memories and don''t be afraid to cry. I am always here for you, Love you XxX', '2007-01-02 07:47:41.000000', '2007-01-02 19:00:53.000000', 0),
